file	key	english	chinese
CIV4DiplomacyText.xml	AI_DIPLO_FIRST_CONTACT_LEADER_PETER_1	Welcome, [CT_NAME]. I am [OUR_NAME], ruler of all of [OUR_CIV_SHORT]. You will find me a fair man to deal with - cruel, but fair. 	
CIV4DiplomacyText.xml	AI_DIPLO_FIRST_CONTACT_LEADER_CATHERINE_1	Well hello there, [CT_NAME]. It is a pleasure to meet you at last! I'm always looking for CLOSER relations with other leaders, if you get my drift...	
CIV4DiplomacyText.xml	AI_DIPLO_FIRST_CONTACT_LEADER_ISABELLA_1	Her most righteous majesty, Isabella, beloved of God and protector of the faith, does condescend to greet you, [CT_NAME]. Do tell me: are you a righteous people, or are you fiendish heathens who need to be wiped off of the face of this fair land?	
CIV4DiplomacyText.xml	AI_DIPLO_REFUSE_TO_TALK_1	Stop pestering me!	
CIV4DiplomacyText.xml	AI_DIPLO_REFUSE_TO_TALK_2	I have nothing to say to you.	
CIV4DiplomacyText.xml	AI_DIPLO_REFUSE_TO_TALK_3	Sorry, [CT_NAME], talk does not interest us!	
CIV4DiplomacyText.xml	AI_DIPLO_REFUSE_TO_TALK_4	Go away. We have nothing to discuss.	
CIV4DiplomacyText.xml	AI_DIPLO_REFUSE_TO_TALK_5	Leave me alone!	
CIV4DiplomacyText.xml	AI_DIPLO_REFUSE_TO_TALK_6	I am not interested in hearing any more of your lies. Go away.	
CIV4DiplomacyText.xml	AI_DIPLO_REFUSE_TO_TALK_LEADER_FRANKLIN_ROOSEVELT_1	[OUR_EMPIRE] does not negotiate with terrorists.	
CIV4DiplomacyText.xml	AI_DIPLO_REFUSE_TO_TALK_LEADER_WASHINGTON_1	We shall not listen to your insidious lies. Begone!	
CIV4DiplomacyText.xml	AI_DIPLO_REFUSE_TO_TALK_LEADER_SALADIN_1	Your words are but the braying of a jackass, [CT_NAME]. Take them elsewhere.	
CIV4DiplomacyText.xml	AI_DIPLO_REFUSE_TO_TALK_LEADER_MONTEZUMA_1	Talk to the ceremonial blade, [CT_NAME].	
CIV4DiplomacyText.xml	AI_DIPLO_REFUSE_TO_TALK_LEADER_QIN_SHI_HUANG_1	The mere sight of you offends me, [CT_NAME]. Begone!	
CIV4DiplomacyText.xml	AI_DIPLO_REFUSE_TO_TALK_LEADER_CHINESE_LEADER_1	[OUR_CIV_SHORT] will not listen to your bourgoise lies!	
CIV4DiplomacyText.xml	AI_DIPLO_REFUSE_TO_TALK_LEADER_HATSHEPSUT_1	Begone, you lying serpent!	
CIV4DiplomacyText.xml	AI_DIPLO_REFUSE_TO_TALK_LEADER_ELIZABETH_1	Go away you horrible little person!	
CIV4DiplomacyText.xml	AI_DIPLO_REFUSE_TO_TALK_LEADER_VICTORIA_1	We are not amused by your meaningless babble, [CT_NAME]!	
CIV4DiplomacyText.xml	AI_DIPLO_REFUSE_TO_TALK_LEADER_LOUIS_XIV_1	Forget it. I have wigs that are smarter than you are.	
CIV4DiplomacyText.xml	AI_DIPLO_REFUSE_TO_TALK_LEADER_NAPOLEON_1	Talk to the massed artillery, [CT_NAME].	
CIV4DiplomacyText.xml	AI_DIPLO_REFUSE_TO_TALK_LEADER_BISMARCK_1	Speak with YOU? Do not make me laugh!	
CIV4DiplomacyText.xml	AI_DIPLO_REFUSE_TO_TALK_LEADER_ALEXANDER_1	I have more important things to do than to exchange lies with you. Come back another day.	
CIV4DiplomacyText.xml	AI_DIPLO_REFUSE_TO_TALK_LEADER_HUAYNA_CAPAC_1	It is a waste of time to speak with fools. Go away.	
CIV4DiplomacyText.xml	AI_DIPLO_REFUSE_TO_TALK_LEADER_ASOKA_1	We will not listen to your lies, [CT_NAME]. Remove yourself from our presence.	
CIV4DiplomacyText.xml	AI_DIPLO_REFUSE_TO_TALK_LEADER_GANDHI_1	Further discussion at this point would be meaningless. Not to mention very annoying. Go away.	
CIV4DiplomacyText.xml	AI_DIPLO_REFUSE_TO_TALK_LEADER_TOKUGAWA_1	I have no time to exchange pleasantries with you, [CT_NAME]: I am too busy plotting your downfall. 	
CIV4DiplomacyText.xml	AI_DIPLO_REFUSE_TO_TALK_LEADER_MANSA_MUSA_1	Take your pathetic lies elsewhere, for I do not wish to hear them.	
CIV4DiplomacyText.xml	AI_DIPLO_REFUSE_TO_TALK_LEADER_GENGHIS_KHAN_1	Bah! This chatter is a waste of time! Begone!	
CIV4DiplomacyText.xml	AI_DIPLO_REFUSE_TO_TALK_LEADER_KUBLAI_KHAN_1	Hello, this is [OUR_NAME]. [OUR_CIV_SHORT] is not at home right now: please leave your name and number and we'll get back to you when pigs have wings.	
CIV4DiplomacyText.xml	AI_DIPLO_REFUSE_TO_TALK_LEADER_CYRUS_1	Vile serpent! [OUR_CIV_SHORT] will not listen to your lies!	
CIV4DiplomacyText.xml	AI_DIPLO_REFUSE_TO_TALK_LEADER_JULIUS_CAESAR_1	Negotiate this, pal!	
CIV4DiplomacyText.xml	AI_DIPLO_REFUSE_TO_TALK_LEADER_PETER_1	Guards! Toss this villain out into the snow before I commit a diplomatic incident!	
CIV4DiplomacyText.xml	AI_DIPLO_REFUSE_TO_TALK_LEADER_CATHERINE_1	I find you strangely unattractive, [CT_NAME]. Do not return until you are better-looking.	
CIV4DiplomacyText.xml	AI_DIPLO_REFUSE_TO_TALK_LEADER_ISABELLA_1	Your lying words pollute the heavens, [CT_NAME]!	
CIV4DiplomacyText.xml	AI_DIPLO_PEACE_1	We look forward to many years of peace between the [OUR_CIV_ADJ] and [CT_CIV_ADJ] Empires.	
CIV4DiplomacyText.xml	AI_DIPLO_PEACE_2	May the peace be eternal.	
CIV4DiplomacyText.xml	AI_DIPLO_PEACE_3	May we all live long and prosper.	
CIV4DiplomacyText.xml	AI_DIPLO_PEACE_4	May this peace last until there is no more room to expand!	
CIV4DiplomacyText.xml	AI_DIPLO_PEACE_5	I look forward to years of peace with you, [CT_NAME].	
CIV4DiplomacyText.xml	AI_DIPLO_PEACE_6	Wonderful!	
CIV4DiplomacyText.xml	AI_DIPLO_PEACE_7	[CT_NAME], let us sit in a circle and sing "Kumbaya" to celebrate this great event!	
CIV4DiplomacyText.xml	AI_DIPLO_PEACE_8	Minions! Prepare a feast to celebrate the peace between our great Empires!	
CIV4DiplomacyText.xml	AI_DIPLO_PEACE_9	You have our gratitude.	
CIV4DiplomacyText.xml	AI_DIPLO_PEACE_10	May the peace last a thousand years.	
CIV4DiplomacyText.xml	AI_DIPLO_PEACE_11	There is no way to peace. Peace is the way.	
CIV4DiplomacyText.xml	AI_DIPLO_PEACE_12	You have chosen wisely.	
CIV4DiplomacyText.xml	AI_DIPLO_PEACE_13	Excellent!	
CIV4DiplomacyText.xml	AI_DIPLO_PEACE_14	I applaud your wisdom.	
CIV4DiplomacyText.xml	AI_DIPLO_PEACE_15	Wonderful.	
CIV4DiplomacyText.xml	AI_DIPLO_PEACE_16	Excellent! Now let us join together and destroy somebody else!	
CIV4DiplomacyText.xml	AI_DIPLO_PEACE_17	You are wiser than you appear, [CT_NAME].	
CIV4DiplomacyText.xml	AI_DIPLO_PEACE_18	Peace with honor, [CT_NAME]: that's what it's all about.	
CIV4DiplomacyText.xml	AI_DIPLO_PEACE_19	You are not as foolish as you first appear, [CT_NAME]. I am pleased.	
CIV4DiplomacyText.xml	AI_DIPLO_PEACE_20	May the peace last until there is no one else to conquer!	
CIV4DiplomacyText.xml	AI_DIPLO_NO_PEACE_1	No way.	
CIV4DiplomacyText.xml	AI_DIPLO_NO_PEACE_2	Not until every last [CT_CIV_ADJ] warrior is ground into dust!	
CIV4DiplomacyText.xml	AI_DIPLO_NO_PEACE_3	Never!	
CIV4DiplomacyText.xml	AI_DIPLO_NO_PEACE_4	There will be no peace, [CT_NAME].	
CIV4DiplomacyText.xml	AI_DIPLO_NO_PEACE_5	Peace? Hah! Forget it.	
CIV4DiplomacyText.xml	AI_DIPLO_NO_PEACE_6	It is much too late for that, [CT_NAME]. Take your punishment like a man!	
CIV4DiplomacyText.xml	AI_DIPLO_NO_PEACE_LEADER_FRANKLIN_ROOSEVELT_1	Certainly not! You've awoken a sleeping tiger, [CT_NAME], and I hope you choke on it.	
CIV4DiplomacyText.xml	AI_DIPLO_NO_PEACE_LEADER_WASHINGTON_1	America does not negotiate with terrorists. 	
CIV4DiplomacyText.xml	AI_DIPLO_NO_PEACE_LEADER_SALADIN_1	Never! You are an enemy of God! Prepare for thy doom!	
CIV4DiplomacyText.xml	AI_DIPLO_NO_PEACE_LEADER_MONTEZUMA_1	No. We have not yet sacrificed enough [CT_CIV_ADJ] warriors to slake the gods' unending thirst for blood. Try back later.	
CIV4DiplomacyText.xml	AI_DIPLO_NO_PEACE_LEADER_QIN_SHI_HUANG_1	No. You have not yet learned the proper respect for your betters.	
CIV4DiplomacyText.xml	AI_DIPLO_NO_PEACE_LEADER_CHINESE_LEADER_1	There can never be peace in the unending war between the people and the bloodsucking bourgoise capitalist opressors who seek to enslave them! That would be you, punk.	
CIV4DiplomacyText.xml	AI_DIPLO_NO_PEACE_LEADER_HATSHEPSUT_1	Gods do not negitiate with mortals - particularly with ugly little slimeballs such as yourself. Go back to your home to await your doom.	
CIV4DiplomacyText.xml	AI_DIPLO_NO_PEACE_LEADER_ELIZABETH_1	Do you plead for mercy, [CT_NAME]? You'll find none here - only justice!	
CIV4DiplomacyText.xml	AI_DIPLO_NO_PEACE_LEADER_VICTORIA_1	War is deeply unpleasant, but sometimes necessary. We're told that this is one of those times, so we must refuse your pleas. This interview is concluded.	
CIV4DiplomacyText.xml	AI_DIPLO_NO_PEACE_LEADER_LOUIS_XIV_1	It is far too late for peace, you silly [CT_CIV_ADJ] person! Now go away or I shall taunt you a second time!	
CIV4DiplomacyText.xml	AI_DIPLO_NO_PEACE_LEADER_NAPOLEON_1	Why should I agree to peace when my [OUR_CIV_ADJ] armies are making such short work of you?	
CIV4DiplomacyText.xml	AI_DIPLO_NO_PEACE_LEADER_BISMARCK_1	Your request is denied. Welcome to total war, [CT_NAME].	
CIV4DiplomacyText.xml	AI_DIPLO_NO_PEACE_LEADER_ALEXANDER_1	Your continued existence is an insult to the mighty [OUR_EMPIRE]. This war shall end when you have been erased from the planet.	
CIV4DiplomacyText.xml	AI_DIPLO_NO_PEACE_LEADER_HUAYNA_CAPAC_1	You may beg and plead all you like, [CT_NAME], but it will do you no good. The war will continue until the gods grow tired of it.	
CIV4DiplomacyText.xml	AI_DIPLO_NO_PEACE_LEADER_ASOKA_1	There shall be no true peace in the world until you are no longer in it. The war continues.	
CIV4DiplomacyText.xml	AI_DIPLO_NO_PEACE_LEADER_GANDHI_1	I may be a pacifist, [CT_NAME], but I'm not an idiot. [OUR_CIV_SHORT] declines your request.	
CIV4DiplomacyText.xml	AI_DIPLO_NO_PEACE_LEADER_TOKUGAWA_1	What? Leave you alive to betray and backstab us again?! I shall not sleep easily until you are totally vanquished!	
CIV4DiplomacyText.xml	AI_DIPLO_NO_PEACE_LEADER_MANSA_MUSA_1	Your nation pollutes the very world with its corruption, [CT_NAME]. You must be exterminated.	
CIV4DiplomacyText.xml	AI_DIPLO_NO_PEACE_LEADER_GENGHIS_KHAN_1	Now? While everybody's having so much fun? I don't think so!	
CIV4DiplomacyText.xml	AI_DIPLO_NO_PEACE_LEADER_KUBLAI_KHAN_1	No! [OUR_CIV_ADJ] laws demand that you be further punished for your insolence!	
CIV4DiplomacyText.xml	AI_DIPLO_NO_PEACE_LEADER_CYRUS_1	You have yet to pay fully for your sins, [CT_NAME]. Your people's sufferings will continue until you have done so.	
CIV4DiplomacyText.xml	AI_DIPLO_NO_PEACE_LEADER_JULIUS_CAESAR_1	I have a better idea - how about I just raze your cities and sow your fields with salt?	
CIV4DiplomacyText.xml	AI_DIPLO_NO_PEACE_LEADER_PETER_1	Mighty [OUR_CIV_SHORT] does not negotiate with the likes of you! Now go before I have my Cossacks hack you to bits!	
CIV4DiplomacyText.xml	AI_DIPLO_NO_PEACE_LEADER_CATHERINE_1	I must refuse, [CT_NAME]; peace is not in our best interests at this time. Besides, I think that men in uniform look totally yummy, don't you?	
CIV4DiplomacyText.xml	AI_DIPLO_NO_PEACE_LEADER_ISABELLA_1	No! God commands that I continue this holy crusade until I have achieved total victory! Begone, churl!	
CIV4DiplomacyText.xml	AI_DIPLO_GREETINGS_ATT_FR_1	Hello, [CT_NAME]. What is it that you wish to discuss?	
CIV4DiplomacyText.xml	AI_DIPLO_GREETINGS_ATT_FR_2	Greetings. What may humble [OUR_CIV_SHORT] do for the mighty [CT_CIV_SHORT]?	
CIV4DiplomacyText.xml	AI_DIPLO_GREETINGS_ATT_FR_3	Greetings.  How may we be of assistance?	
CIV4DiplomacyText.xml	AI_DIPLO_GREETINGS_ATT_FR_4	Welcome, friend [CT_NAME]. How may we be of assistance?	
CIV4DiplomacyText.xml	AI_DIPLO_GREETINGS_ATT_FR_5	Hello again!	
CIV4DiplomacyText.xml	AI_DIPLO_GREETINGS_ATT_FR_6	Good day to you, [CT_NAME].	
CIV4DiplomacyText.xml	AI_DIPLO_GREETINGS_ATT_FR_7	So what's going on?	
CIV4DiplomacyText.xml	AI_DIPLO_GREETINGS_ATT_FR_8	Hello, [CT_NAME]. What can I do for you?	
CIV4DiplomacyText.xml	AI_DIPLO_GREETINGS_ATT_FR_9	What is on your mind?	
CIV4DiplomacyText.xml	AI_DIPLO_GREETINGS_ATT_FR_10	To what do I owe the pleasure of your company?'	
CIV4DiplomacyText.xml	AI_DIPLO_GREETINGS_ATT_FR_11	Greetings, [CT_NAME]; how may we be of service?	
CIV4DiplomacyText.xml	AI_DIPLO_GREETINGS_ATT_FR_12	Welcome, [CT_NAME], to my home.	
CIV4DiplomacyText.xml	AI_DIPLO_GREETINGS_ATT_FR_13	Hello, [CT_NAME], leader of mighty [CT_CIV_SHORT].	
CIV4DiplomacyText.xml	AI_DIPLO_GREETINGS_ATT_FR_14	And what brings [CT_CIV_SHORT] to my humble palace?	
CIV4DiplomacyText.xml	AI_DIPLO_GREETINGS_ATT_FR_15	How may the [OUR_EMPIRE] assist mighty [CT_CIV_SHORT]?	
CIV4DiplomacyText.xml	AI_DIPLO_GREETINGS_ATT_FR_16	And to what do I owe the pleasure of your company?	
CIV4DiplomacyText.xml	AI_DIPLO_GREETINGS_ATT_FR_LEADER_WASHINGTON_1	Greetings, [CT_NAME]. How was your journey from the [CT_EMPIRE]? I slept there once, you know. 	
CIV4DiplomacyText.xml	AI_DIPLO_GREETINGS_ATT_FR_LEADER_FRANKLIN_ROOSEVELT_1	How absolutely marvey to see you again, [CT_NAME]! Do sit down; my man will get you a Martini.	
CIV4DiplomacyText.xml	AI_DIPLO_GREETINGS_ATT_FR_LEADER_SALADIN_1	Blessings be upon you, oh mighty [CT_NAME]! Your glorious personage bestows great honor upon my humble kingdom!	
CIV4DiplomacyText.xml	AI_DIPLO_GREETINGS_ATT_FR_LEADER_MONTEZUMA_1	Welcome, friend [CT_NAME]! I will slaughter many slaves in celebration of your visit!	
CIV4DiplomacyText.xml	AI_DIPLO_GREETINGS_ATT_FR_LEADER_QIN_SHI_HUANG_1	Greetings, [CT_NAME]! Who shall we betray and destroy today?	
CIV4DiplomacyText.xml	AI_DIPLO_GREETINGS_ATT_FR_LEADER_CHINESE_LEADER_1	On behalf of the great and glorious Communist Party of China and of all of her horrible little peasants - I mean, "glorious workers" - greetings!	
CIV4DiplomacyText.xml	AI_DIPLO_GREETINGS_ATT_FR_LEADER_HATSHEPSUT_1	Hello again, [CT_NAME]. How honored you must be to see me once more.	
CIV4DiplomacyText.xml	AI_DIPLO_GREETINGS_ATT_FR_LEADER_ELIZABETH_1	Good afternoon, [CT_NAME]. And how is that quaint little empire of yours doing?	
CIV4DiplomacyText.xml	AI_DIPLO_GREETINGS_ATT_FR_LEADER_VICTORIA_1	On behalf of Mighty Britannia, we are almost pleased to grant you an audience, [CT_NAME].	
CIV4DiplomacyText.xml	AI_DIPLO_GREETINGS_ATT_FR_LEADER_LOUIS_XIV_1	Welcome to my palace, [CT_NAME]. Care to watch me shave?	
CIV4DiplomacyText.xml	AI_DIPLO_GREETINGS_ATT_FR_LEADER_NAPOLEON_1	I am quite busy today, [CT_NAME], but perhaps I can grant you a short audience.	
CIV4DiplomacyText.xml	AI_DIPLO_GREETINGS_ATT_FR_LEADER_BISMARCK_1	[OUR_CIV_SHORT] salutes you, [CT_NAME]. Come - sit down and admire my huge mustaches!	
CIV4DiplomacyText.xml	AI_DIPLO_GREETINGS_ATT_FR_LEADER_ALEXANDER_1	Welcome, my friend! Come, let us mount our chariots and destroy our foes, leaving fifty thousand rotting corpses upon the battlefield for the crows to fatten upon!	
CIV4DiplomacyText.xml	AI_DIPLO_GREETINGS_ATT_FR_LEADER_HUAYNA_CAPAC_1	I, [OUR_NAME], do welcome you, [CT_NAME], leader of the [CT_EMPIRE]. Let us speak of the slow, painful deaths of our enemies! Care for a smoked hamster?	
CIV4DiplomacyText.xml	AI_DIPLO_GREETINGS_ATT_FR_LEADER_ASOKA_1	Greetings, fair [CT_NAME]! May our two countries live forever in peace and harmony!	
CIV4DiplomacyText.xml	AI_DIPLO_GREETINGS_ATT_FR_LEADER_GANDHI_1	Greetings, [CT_NAME]. I trust you have come in peace?	
CIV4DiplomacyText.xml	AI_DIPLO_GREETINGS_ATT_FR_LEADER_TOKUGAWA_1	It is good to see you again, [CT_NAME]! Let us sit down and plot the ruination of our enemies. 	
CIV4DiplomacyText.xml	AI_DIPLO_GREETINGS_ATT_FR_LEADER_MANSA_MUSA_1	We meet again, [CT_NAME]. It is truly a blessed day for [OUR_CIV_SHORT]!	
CIV4DiplomacyText.xml	AI_DIPLO_GREETINGS_ATT_FR_LEADER_GENGHIS_KHAN_1	Welcome to my yurt, [CT_NAME]! Let us sit upon these horse-hair cushions and discuss many things! Care for some boiled yak?	
CIV4DiplomacyText.xml	AI_DIPLO_GREETINGS_ATT_FR_LEADER_KUBLAI_KHAN_1	Welcome to China, [CT_NAME]! Let us sit upon these golden thrones and discuss many things! Care for some kung pao yak?	
CIV4DiplomacyText.xml	AI_DIPLO_GREETINGS_ATT_FR_LEADER_CYRUS_1	I salute you, ruler of the [CT_EMPIRE]. May your inevitable destruction at the hands of Mighty [OUR_CIV_SHORT] be long delayed!	
CIV4DiplomacyText.xml	AI_DIPLO_GREETINGS_ATT_FR_LEADER_JULIUS_CAESAR_1	Greetings, my friend. What may I, [OUR_NAME], Emperor of Mighty [OUR_CIV_SHORT], do for your insignificant civilization today?	
CIV4DiplomacyText.xml	AI_DIPLO_GREETINGS_ATT_FR_LEADER_PETER_1	Mighty [OUR_CIV_SHORT] greets you in friendship, [CT_NAME]. And in a drunken stupor too. 	
CIV4DiplomacyText.xml	AI_DIPLO_GREETINGS_ATT_FR_LEADER_CATHERINE_1	Welcome, [CT_NAME]. Is that a treaty in your pocket or are you just glad to see me?	
CIV4DiplomacyText.xml	AI_DIPLO_GREETINGS_ATT_FR_LEADER_ISABELLA_1	Her most righteous majesty, [OUR_NAME], beloved of God and protector of the faith, does condescend to greet you once more, [CT_NAME].	
CIV4DiplomacyText.xml	AI_DIPLO_GREETINGS_ATT_FUR_1	Well?	
CIV4DiplomacyText.xml	AI_DIPLO_GREETINGS_ATT_FUR_2	What is it?	
CIV4DiplomacyText.xml	AI_DIPLO_GREETINGS_ATT_FUR_3	Well? Get on with it!	
CIV4DiplomacyText.xml	AI_DIPLO_GREETINGS_ATT_FUR_4	What do YOU want?	
CIV4DiplomacyText.xml	AI_DIPLO_GREETINGS_ATT_FUR_5	Let's hear it.	
CIV4DiplomacyText.xml	AI_DIPLO_GREETINGS_ATT_FUR_6	What is it this time, [CT_NAME]?	
CIV4DiplomacyText.xml	AI_DIPLO_GREETINGS_ATT_FUR_7	My time is valuable, [CT_NAME]. What do you want?	
CIV4DiplomacyText.xml	AI_DIPLO_GREETINGS_ATT_FUR_8	Do not make me angry, [CT_NAME]. You wouldn't like me when I'm angry.	
CIV4DiplomacyText.xml	AI_DIPLO_GREETINGS_ATT_FUR_9	And what does puny [CT_CIV_SHORT] want from mighty [OUR_CIV_SHORT]?	
CIV4DiplomacyText.xml	AI_DIPLO_GREETINGS_ATT_FUR_10	Speak your piece, [CT_NAME] - I haven't got all day.	
CIV4DiplomacyText.xml	AI_DIPLO_GREETINGS_ATT_FUR_11	Are you still around? I thought somebody wiped out your puny civilization years ago.	
CIV4DiplomacyText.xml	AI_DIPLO_GREETINGS_ATT_FUR_12	Oh, it's you. Now my day is complete.	
CIV4DiplomacyText.xml	AI_DIPLO_GREETINGS_ATT_FUR_13	Well, look what the cat dragged in.	
CIV4DiplomacyText.xml	AI_DIPLO_GREETINGS_ATT_FUR_14	I studied on killin' you.	
CIV4DiplomacyText.xml	AI_DIPLO_GREETINGS_ATT_FUR_15	You try my patience, [CT_NAME].	
CIV4DiplomacyText.xml	AI_DIPLO_GREETINGS_ATT_FUR_16	I'm listening.	
CIV4DiplomacyText.xml	AI_DIPLO_GREETINGS_ATT_FUR_LEADER_WASHINGTON_1	What could [CT_CIV_SHORT] possibly have to say that would be of interest to [OUR_CIV_SHORT]?	
CIV4DiplomacyText.xml	AI_DIPLO_GREETINGS_ATT_FUR_LEADER_FRANKLIN_ROOSEVELT_1	Come to add to our troubles, have you? Well, get on with it then.	
CIV4DiplomacyText.xml	AI_DIPLO_GREETINGS_ATT_FUR_LEADER_SALADIN_1	What a surprise! I did not realize it was locust season once again.	
CIV4DiplomacyText.xml	AI_DIPLO_GREETINGS_ATT_FUR_LEADER_MONTEZUMA_1	Tell me, [CT_NAME]: what has [CT_CIV_SHORT] done to anger the gods so that they give them you as leader?	
CIV4DiplomacyText.xml	AI_DIPLO_GREETINGS_ATT_FUR_LEADER_QIN_SHI_HUANG_1	Greetings, [CT_NAME]! We are, as always, happy to see you again.	
CIV4DiplomacyText.xml	AI_DIPLO_GREETINGS_ATT_FUR_LEADER_CHINESE_LEADER_1	It is people like you, [CT_NAME], who give ruthless dictators a bad name. Why are you here?	
CIV4DiplomacyText.xml	AI_DIPLO_GREETINGS_ATT_FUR_LEADER_HATSHEPSUT_1	Bow before me, [CT_NAME] - a goddess deserves no less!	
CIV4DiplomacyText.xml	AI_DIPLO_GREETINGS_ATT_FUR_LEADER_ELIZABETH_1	Well? Out with it, you tiresome little person!	
CIV4DiplomacyText.xml	AI_DIPLO_GREETINGS_ATT_FUR_LEADER_VICTORIA_1	Good day to you, [CT_NAME]. To what do we owe this unexpected interruption?	
CIV4DiplomacyText.xml	AI_DIPLO_GREETINGS_ATT_FUR_LEADER_LOUIS_XIV_1	Back again so soon, [CT_NAME]? How glorious. Imagine my excitement.	
CIV4DiplomacyText.xml	AI_DIPLO_GREETINGS_ATT_FUR_LEADER_NAPOLEON_1	I have little time for your prattle, [CT_NAME]. That is the long and short of it.	
CIV4DiplomacyText.xml	AI_DIPLO_GREETINGS_ATT_FUR_LEADER_BISMARCK_1	Get to the point, [CT_NAME]. I have IMPORTANT matters of state to deal with.	
CIV4DiplomacyText.xml	AI_DIPLO_GREETINGS_ATT_FUR_LEADER_ALEXANDER_1	Still alive, are you? How disappointing. 	
CIV4DiplomacyText.xml	AI_DIPLO_GREETINGS_ATT_FUR_LEADER_HUAYNA_CAPAC_1	It is a source of unending astonishment to me that the gods permit you to live, [CT_NAME]. Why are you here?	
CIV4DiplomacyText.xml	AI_DIPLO_GREETINGS_ATT_FUR_LEADER_ASOKA_1	Why have you come to trouble us, [CT_NAME]?	
CIV4DiplomacyText.xml	AI_DIPLO_GREETINGS_ATT_FUR_LEADER_GANDHI_1	All people, no matter how unpleasant, are welcome in [OUR_CIV_SHORT], [CT_NAME].	
CIV4DiplomacyText.xml	AI_DIPLO_GREETINGS_ATT_FUR_LEADER_TOKUGAWA_1	Greetings, [CT_NAME]! [OUR_CIV_SHORT] is honored by your visit. You can be sure that we will be coming to your country very soon now. 	
CIV4DiplomacyText.xml	AI_DIPLO_GREETINGS_ATT_FUR_LEADER_MANSA_MUSA_1	I do not approve of you or your country, [CT_NAME]. What have you to say that will change my opinion of you?	
CIV4DiplomacyText.xml	AI_DIPLO_GREETINGS_ATT_FUR_LEADER_GENGHIS_KHAN_1	And they call US barbarians?	
CIV4DiplomacyText.xml	AI_DIPLO_GREETINGS_ATT_FUR_LEADER_KUBLAI_KHAN_1	My grandfather would have destroyed you on sight, [CT_NAME]. Alas, but I live in more "civilized" times. What do you want?	
CIV4DiplomacyText.xml	AI_DIPLO_GREETINGS_ATT_FUR_LEADER_CYRUS_1	I wonder, [CT_NAME]: how many hanging chads did it take to get YOU into office?	
CIV4DiplomacyText.xml	AI_DIPLO_GREETINGS_ATT_FUR_LEADER_JULIUS_CAESAR_1	Why are you here? Is it the Ides of March already?	
CIV4DiplomacyText.xml	AI_DIPLO_GREETINGS_ATT_FUR_LEADER_PETER_1	Be brief, [CT_NAME]. I'm trying to give up hacking annoying people to death in a blind rage for Lent. 	
CIV4DiplomacyText.xml	AI_DIPLO_GREETINGS_ATT_FUR_LEADER_CATHERINE_1	Remarkable: a politician who even I won't sleep with.	
CIV4DiplomacyText.xml	AI_DIPLO_GREETINGS_ATT_FUR_LEADER_ISABELLA_1	I'm glad you're here, [CT_NAME]. My Grand Inquisitor would like to have a word with you.	
CIV4DiplomacyText.xml	AI_DIPLO_TRADING_1	So what do you propose?	
CIV4DiplomacyText.xml	AI_DIPLO_TRADING_2	Make an offer.	
CIV4DiplomacyText.xml	AI_DIPLO_TRADING_3	Let us begin!	
CIV4DiplomacyText.xml	AI_DIPLO_TRADING_4	Hopefully we can come to an agreement.	
CIV4DiplomacyText.xml	AI_DIPLO_TRADING_5	What does [CT_CIV_SHORT] have to offer?	
CIV4DiplomacyText.xml	AI_DIPLO_TRADING_6	I'm listening...	
CIV4DiplomacyText.xml	AI_DIPLO_TRADING_7	We're always looking for a fair exchange, [CT_NAME]. Please go ahead.	
CIV4DiplomacyText.xml	AI_DIPLO_TRADING_8	Go on.	
CIV4DiplomacyText.xml	AI_DIPLO_TRADING_9	Well, go ahead and put something on the table.	
CIV4DiplomacyText.xml	AI_DIPLO_TRADING_10	All right. Let's hear it then.	
CIV4DiplomacyText.xml	AI_DIPLO_ACCEPT_1	Agreed.	
CIV4DiplomacyText.xml	AI_DIPLO_ACCEPT_2	All right then. Agreed.	
CIV4DiplomacyText.xml	AI_DIPLO_ACCEPT_3	Done.	
CIV4DiplomacyText.xml	AI_DIPLO_ACCEPT_4	Excellent. We are agreed.	
CIV4DiplomacyText.xml	AI_DIPLO_ACCEPT_5	Hrmph. This is highway robbery - but we'll take it.	
CIV4DiplomacyText.xml	AI_DIPLO_ACCEPT_6	Well, if that's the best you can do, I guess we'll take it. Done.	
CIV4DiplomacyText.xml	AI_DIPLO_ACCEPT_7	I agree to your terms.	
CIV4DiplomacyText.xml	AI_DIPLO_ACCEPT_8	I believe we can accept that. Agreed.	
CIV4DiplomacyText.xml	AI_DIPLO_ACCEPT_9	I think I can accept these terms. It is agreed.	
CIV4DiplomacyText.xml	AI_DIPLO_ACCEPT_10	It is agreed.	
CIV4DiplomacyText.xml	AI_DIPLO_ACCEPT_11	It's against my better judgment, but we'll take it. Done.	
CIV4DiplomacyText.xml	AI_DIPLO_ACCEPT_12	Sounds fair to me. Done.	
CIV4DiplomacyText.xml	AI_DIPLO_ACCEPT_13	That is acceptable to us. Done.	
CIV4DiplomacyText.xml	AI_DIPLO_ACCEPT_14	I dislike haggling. Agreed.	
CIV4DiplomacyText.xml	AI_DIPLO_ACCEPT_15	The offer is a bit light - but we'll agree to it.	
CIV4DiplomacyText.xml	AI_DIPLO_ACCEPT_16	We accept your fair offer.	
CIV4DiplomacyText.xml	AI_DIPLO_ACCEPT_17	We accept your gracious offer.	
CIV4DiplomacyText.xml	AI_DIPLO_ACCEPT_18	We are agreed then.	
CIV4DiplomacyText.xml	AI_DIPLO_ACCEPT_19	We can accept these terms. Done.	
CIV4DiplomacyText.xml	AI_DIPLO_ACCEPT_20	We can do business along these lines. Agreed.	
CIV4DiplomacyText.xml	AI_DIPLO_ACCEPT_21	We'll take it.	
CIV4DiplomacyText.xml	AI_DIPLO_ACCEPT_22	Very well, we'll take it.	
CIV4DiplomacyText.xml	AI_DIPLO_ACCEPT_23	It's a good deal. Done.	
CIV4DiplomacyText.xml	AI_DIPLO_ACCEPT_24	Your terms are acceptable.	
CIV4DiplomacyText.xml	AI_DIPLO_ACCEPT_25	You are a hard bargainer, [CT_NAME]. Agreed.	
CIV4DiplomacyText.xml	AI_DIPLO_ACCEPT_26	Excellent. It is done.	
CIV4DiplomacyText.xml	AI_DIPLO_ACCEPT_27	[OUR_CIV_SHORT] thanks you. Done.	
CIV4DiplomacyText.xml	AI_DIPLO_FR_REJECT_1	You'll have to do better than that, [CT_NAME].	
CIV4DiplomacyText.xml	AI_DIPLO_FR_REJECT_2	We really do not think this trade will benefit our people.	
CIV4DiplomacyText.xml	AI_DIPLO_FR_REJECT_3	This proposal will not work for us.	
CIV4DiplomacyText.xml	AI_DIPLO_FR_REJECT_4	No, seriously. Quit fooling around: what's your offer?	
CIV4DiplomacyText.xml	AI_DIPLO_FR_REJECT_5	That's not good enough, friend [CT_NAME].	
CIV4DiplomacyText.xml	AI_DIPLO_FR_REJECT_6	Is that your final offer? 	
CIV4DiplomacyText.xml	AI_DIPLO_FR_REJECT_7	I'm afraid that your offer is not acceptable to the [OUR_CIV_ADJ] people.	
CIV4DiplomacyText.xml	AI_DIPLO_FR_REJECT_8	No can do, my friend. 	
CIV4DiplomacyText.xml	AI_DIPLO_FR_REJECT_9	We cannot afford to be so generous, [CT_NAME]. Try again.	
CIV4DiplomacyText.xml	AI_DIPLO_FR_REJECT_10	I don't think so. You'll have to do better than that.	
CIV4DiplomacyText.xml	AI_DIPLO_FUR_REJECT_1	We reject your proposal.  No thanks.	
CIV4DiplomacyText.xml	AI_DIPLO_FUR_REJECT_2	Forget it.	
CIV4DiplomacyText.xml	AI_DIPLO_FUR_REJECT_3	We reject your laughable offer.	
CIV4DiplomacyText.xml	AI_DIPLO_FUR_REJECT_4	Just how gullible do you think I am, [CT_NAME]?	
CIV4DiplomacyText.xml	AI_DIPLO_FUR_REJECT_5	Your generosity is underwhelming. Forget it.	
CIV4DiplomacyText.xml	AI_DIPLO_FUR_REJECT_6	This is totally unacceptable!	
CIV4DiplomacyText.xml	AI_DIPLO_FUR_REJECT_7	Just who do you think you're dealing with, [CT_NAME]?	
CIV4DiplomacyText.xml	AI_DIPLO_FUR_REJECT_8	Your offer is an insult to [OUR_CIV_SHORT]. 	
CIV4DiplomacyText.xml	AI_DIPLO_FUR_REJECT_9	Now that's just crazy talk. 	
CIV4DiplomacyText.xml	AI_DIPLO_FUR_REJECT_10	Quit wasting my time. Make a reasonable offer or go away.	
CIV4DiplomacyText.xml	AI_DIPLO_FR_GLAD_1	We're glad you accepted our offer.	
CIV4DiplomacyText.xml	AI_DIPLO_FR_GLAD_2	It is wonderful that you have accepted.	
CIV4DiplomacyText.xml	AI_DIPLO_FR_GLAD_3	I'm glad that you found the offer acceptable, [CT_NAME]	
CIV4DiplomacyText.xml	AI_DIPLO_FR_GLAD_4	Marvelous!	
CIV4DiplomacyText.xml	AI_DIPLO_FR_GLAD_5	You have chosen wisely, [CT_NAME].	
CIV4DiplomacyText.xml	AI_DIPLO_FR_GLAD_6	Wonderful! Let us celebrate!!	
CIV4DiplomacyText.xml	AI_DIPLO_FR_GLAD_7	It's a pleasure doing business with you.	
CIV4DiplomacyText.xml	AI_DIPLO_FR_GLAD_8	Excellent!	
CIV4DiplomacyText.xml	AI_DIPLO_FR_GLAD_9	I'm glad that we could come to an agreement.	
CIV4DiplomacyText.xml	AI_DIPLO_FR_GLAD_10	Cha-CHING!	
CIV4DiplomacyText.xml	AI_DIPLO_FUR_GLAD_1	All right then. We're agreed.	
CIV4DiplomacyText.xml	AI_DIPLO_FUR_GLAD_2	Now you are beginning to show some sense, [CT_NAME]. Perhaps there is some hope for you yet.	
CIV4DiplomacyText.xml	AI_DIPLO_FUR_GLAD_3	Done.	
CIV4DiplomacyText.xml	AI_DIPLO_FUR_GLAD_4	Excellent. Perhaps you are not as foolish as you look.	
CIV4DiplomacyText.xml	AI_DIPLO_FUR_GLAD_5	Mighty  [OUR_CIV_SHORT] thanks you. You may go now.	
CIV4DiplomacyText.xml	AI_DIPLO_FUR_GLAD_6	Thank you for your cooperation.	
CIV4DiplomacyText.xml	AI_DIPLO_FUR_GLAD_7	We thank you. 	
CIV4DiplomacyText.xml	AI_DIPLO_FUR_GLAD_8	That is all for now. 	
CIV4DiplomacyText.xml	AI_DIPLO_FUR_GLAD_9	Fine. It is done.	
CIV4DiplomacyText.xml	AI_DIPLO_FUR_GLAD_10	[OUR_CIV_SHORT] thanks you and your petty little civilization.	
CIV4DiplomacyText.xml	AI_DIPLO_FR_SORRY_1	We're sorry you don't feel that our offer is reasonable.	
CIV4DiplomacyText.xml	AI_DIPLO_FR_SORRY_2	Too bad. Do you have something different in mind?	
CIV4DiplomacyText.xml	AI_DIPLO_FR_SORRY_3	Let's hear an offer from you, then.	
CIV4DiplomacyText.xml	AI_DIPLO_FR_SORRY_4	All right. Why don't you put something on the table?	
CIV4DiplomacyText.xml	AI_DIPLO_FR_SORRY_5	Well, do you wish to make a counter-proposal?	
CIV4DiplomacyText.xml	AI_DIPLO_FR_SORRY_6	All right: let's hear your counter-proposal.	
CIV4DiplomacyText.xml	AI_DIPLO_FR_SORRY_7	That is regrettable.	
CIV4DiplomacyText.xml	AI_DIPLO_FR_SORRY_8	That is unfortunate.	
CIV4DiplomacyText.xml	AI_DIPLO_FR_SORRY_9	Oh well. Perhaps next time, then.	
CIV4DiplomacyText.xml	AI_DIPLO_FR_SORRY_10	Well, perhaps you would care to suggest something then.	
CIV4DiplomacyText.xml	AI_DIPLO_FUR_SORRY_1	Well, you suggest something then!	
CIV4DiplomacyText.xml	AI_DIPLO_FUR_SORRY_2	How typical. Let's hear your brilliant. idea then.	
CIV4DiplomacyText.xml	AI_DIPLO_FUR_SORRY_3	You annoy me, [CT_NAME].	
CIV4DiplomacyText.xml	AI_DIPLO_FUR_SORRY_4	You are incredibly stubborn, [CT_NAME]. 	
CIV4DiplomacyText.xml	AI_DIPLO_FUR_SORRY_5	You are remarkably short-sighted, [CT_NAME], to treat your betters thusly.	
CIV4DiplomacyText.xml	AI_DIPLO_FUR_SORRY_6	I suppose you have something better in mind?	
CIV4DiplomacyText.xml	AI_DIPLO_FUR_SORRY_7	Then quit wasting my time. Either make a counter-proposal or be gone.	
CIV4DiplomacyText.xml	AI_DIPLO_FUR_SORRY_8	Let's hear your idea, then.	
CIV4DiplomacyText.xml	AI_DIPLO_FUR_SORRY_9	Then you put something on the table!	
CIV4DiplomacyText.xml	AI_DIPLO_FUR_SORRY_10	Does puny [CT_CIV_SHORT] wish to make a counter-proposal? 	
CIV4DiplomacyText.xml	AI_DIPLO_TRY_THIS_DEAL_1	How does this deal sound?	
CIV4DiplomacyText.xml	AI_DIPLO_TRY_THIS_DEAL_2	What do you think of this deal, [CT_NAME]?	
CIV4DiplomacyText.xml	AI_DIPLO_TRY_THIS_DEAL_3	Do you find this offer tempting?	
CIV4DiplomacyText.xml	AI_DIPLO_TRY_THIS_DEAL_4	Here's my offer.	
CIV4DiplomacyText.xml	AI_DIPLO_TRY_THIS_DEAL_5	I'm sure that you'll agree that this deal is fair...	
CIV4DiplomacyText.xml	AI_DIPLO_TRY_THIS_DEAL_6	And that's my final offer. 	
CIV4DiplomacyText.xml	AI_DIPLO_FR_NO_DEAL_1	I don't see how a deal is possible.	
CIV4DiplomacyText.xml	AI_DIPLO_FR_NO_DEAL_2	That's just crazy-talk. I don't think it can be done.	
CIV4DiplomacyText.xml	AI_DIPLO_FR_NO_DEAL_3	I'm sorry to say that no such deal is possible.	
CIV4DiplomacyText.xml	AI_DIPLO_FR_NO_DEAL_4	That can't be done, [CT_NAME].	
CIV4DiplomacyText.xml	AI_DIPLO_FR_NO_DEAL_5	I don't see how we can make such a trade.	
CIV4DiplomacyText.xml	AI_DIPLO_FR_NO_DEAL_6	We can't do that.	
CIV4DiplomacyText.xml	AI_DIPLO_FUR_NO_DEAL_1	That's impossible. 	
CIV4DiplomacyText.xml	AI_DIPLO_FUR_NO_DEAL_2	Don't be foolish. That can't possibly be done.	
CIV4DiplomacyText.xml	AI_DIPLO_FUR_NO_DEAL_3	Don't waste my time with impossibilities!	
CIV4DiplomacyText.xml	AI_DIPLO_FUR_NO_DEAL_4	What are you talking about? That's not possible.	
CIV4DiplomacyText.xml	AI_DIPLO_FUR_NO_DEAL_5	Are you kidding? That can't be done!	
CIV4DiplomacyText.xml	AI_DIPLO_FUR_NO_DEAL_6	There's no way such a deal is possible.	
CIV4DiplomacyText.xml	AI_DIPLO_OFFER_PEACE_1	Perhaps it is time for all this bloodshed to end?	
CIV4DiplomacyText.xml	AI_DIPLO_OFFER_CITY_1	We would like to offer up this city as a sign of our respect.	
CIV4DiplomacyText.xml	AI_DIPLO_FR_OFFER_DEAL_1	Greetings, [CT_NAME]! What do you think of this deal?	
CIV4DiplomacyText.xml	AI_DIPLO_FR_OFFER_DEAL_2	The peace-loving people of [OUR_CIV_SHORT] seek a fair trade with [CT_CIV_SHORT]. How about it?	
CIV4DiplomacyText.xml	AI_DIPLO_FR_OFFER_DEAL_3	How does this sound to you, [CT_NAME]?	
CIV4DiplomacyText.xml	AI_DIPLO_FR_OFFER_DEAL_4	What do you think of this deal, [CT_NAME]?	
CIV4DiplomacyText.xml	AI_DIPLO_FR_OFFER_DEAL_5	My friend, can [OUR_CIV_SHORT] tempt you with this offer?	
CIV4DiplomacyText.xml	AI_DIPLO_FR_OFFER_DEAL_6	Let's make a deal!	
CIV4DiplomacyText.xml	AI_DIPLO_FUR_OFFER_DEAL_1	[CT_NAME], I'm making you an offer you can't refuse.	
CIV4DiplomacyText.xml	AI_DIPLO_FUR_OFFER_DEAL_2	Show some intelligence for a change, [CT_NAME]. Accept this deal.	
CIV4DiplomacyText.xml	AI_DIPLO_FUR_OFFER_DEAL_3	The [OUR_EMPIRE] offers you this trade. I suggest you take it.	
CIV4DiplomacyText.xml	AI_DIPLO_FUR_OFFER_DEAL_4	Here's our offer. Take it or leave it.	
CIV4DiplomacyText.xml	AI_DIPLO_FUR_OFFER_DEAL_5	[OUR_CIV_SHORT] offers your nasty little civilization the following deal.	
CIV4DiplomacyText.xml	AI_DIPLO_FUR_OFFER_DEAL_6	Here's the deal. 	
CIV4DiplomacyText.xml	AI_DIPLO_FR_CANCEL_DEAL_1	I'm afraid this deal will no longer work for us.	
CIV4DiplomacyText.xml	AI_DIPLO_FR_CANCEL_DEAL_2	I'm sorry, [CT_NAME], but this deal will no longer work for us.	
CIV4DiplomacyText.xml	AI_DIPLO_FR_CANCEL_DEAL_3	All good things come to an end, unfortunately. Including this deal.	
CIV4DiplomacyText.xml	AI_DIPLO_FR_CANCEL_DEAL_4	[OUR_CIV_SHORT] can no longer afford this deal, [CT_NAME]. 	
CIV4DiplomacyText.xml	AI_DIPLO_FR_CANCEL_DEAL_5	It's time to end this deal, friend. 	
CIV4DiplomacyText.xml	AI_DIPLO_FR_CANCEL_DEAL_6	If you don't mind, [OUR_CIV_SHORT] would like to cancel this deal.	
CIV4DiplomacyText.xml	AI_DIPLO_FUR_CANCEL_DEAL_1	The [OUR_CIV_ADJ] people are no longer interested in this deal, [CT_NAME]. 	
CIV4DiplomacyText.xml	AI_DIPLO_FUR_CANCEL_DEAL_2	This deal is over. 	
CIV4DiplomacyText.xml	AI_DIPLO_FUR_CANCEL_DEAL_3	We're ending this deal, [CT_NAME]. 	
CIV4DiplomacyText.xml	AI_DIPLO_FUR_CANCEL_DEAL_4	We're sick of this deal. And of you, too, frankly.	
CIV4DiplomacyText.xml	AI_DIPLO_FUR_CANCEL_DEAL_5	We are terminating this deal, [CT_NAME], effective immediately.	
CIV4DiplomacyText.xml	AI_DIPLO_FUR_CANCEL_DEAL_6	This deal no longer suits our needs. It is canceled. 	
CIV4DiplomacyText.xml	AI_DIPLO_THANKS_1	[OUR_NAME] thanks you on behalf of the grateful [OUR_CIV_ADJ] people!	
CIV4DiplomacyText.xml	AI_DIPLO_THANKS_2	[OUR_CIV_SHORT] acknowledges your friendship. Thank you.	
CIV4DiplomacyText.xml	AI_DIPLO_THANKS_3	[OUR_CIV_SHORT] graciously acknowledges your friendship, [CT_NAME].	
CIV4DiplomacyText.xml	AI_DIPLO_THANKS_4	[OUR_CIV_SHORT] salutes its friend, the tiny nation of [CT_CIV_SHORT].	
CIV4DiplomacyText.xml	AI_DIPLO_THANKS_5	[OUR_CIV_SHORT] salutes you, [CT_NAME]!	
CIV4DiplomacyText.xml	AI_DIPLO_THANKS_6	[OUR_CIV_SHORT] thanks you, [CT_NAME].	
CIV4DiplomacyText.xml	AI_DIPLO_THANKS_7	[OUR_CIV_SHORT] thanks you, fair and generous [CT_NAME]!	
CIV4DiplomacyText.xml	AI_DIPLO_THANKS_8	[CT_NAME], my people thank you.	
CIV4DiplomacyText.xml	AI_DIPLO_THANKS_9	Excellent! I'm quite pleased. Let's sit down and have a jolly cup of tea, shall we?	
CIV4DiplomacyText.xml	AI_DIPLO_THANKS_10	Good decision. We must build a closer bond - or else!	
CIV4DiplomacyText.xml	AI_DIPLO_THANKS_11	I [OUR_NAME], Godlike Ruler of the Mighty [OUR_EMPIRE], do hereby offer my sincerest thanks to my good friend, [CT_NAME].	
CIV4DiplomacyText.xml	AI_DIPLO_THANKS_12	I am glad that we have concluded this arrangement amicably, [CT_NAME].	
CIV4DiplomacyText.xml	AI_DIPLO_THANKS_13	I am so happy that our two nations can rise above petty rivalries like this! We will set an example the whole world will follow!	
CIV4DiplomacyText.xml	AI_DIPLO_THANKS_14	I am SO pleased that we have been able to come to a fair agreement, [CT_NAME]!	
CIV4DiplomacyText.xml	AI_DIPLO_THANKS_15	I appreciate this, friend [CT_NAME]. Thanks from all the [OUR_CIV_ADJ] people!	
CIV4DiplomacyText.xml	AI_DIPLO_THANKS_16	I bow before you in friendship, [CT_NAME]!	
CIV4DiplomacyText.xml	AI_DIPLO_THANKS_17	I congratulate you on your common sense, [CT_NAME].	
CIV4DiplomacyText.xml	AI_DIPLO_THANKS_18	I thank you. Now I'm sure that you have pressing business elsewhere...	
CIV4DiplomacyText.xml	AI_DIPLO_THANKS_19	I will sacrifice fifty warriors in honor of your friendship!	
CIV4DiplomacyText.xml	AI_DIPLO_THANKS_20	I, [OUR_NAME], ruler of way too many places to mention, do hereby thank my good friend, [CT_NAME]!	
CIV4DiplomacyText.xml	AI_DIPLO_THANKS_21	It has been a pleasure doing business with you, [CT_NAME].	
CIV4DiplomacyText.xml	AI_DIPLO_THANKS_22	It is good that we can come together as equals, [CT_NAME].	
CIV4DiplomacyText.xml	AI_DIPLO_THANKS_23	We enjoyed speaking with you [CT_NAME]. Odd, since you are so far inferior, but personality goes a long way.	
CIV4DiplomacyText.xml	AI_DIPLO_THANKS_24	You are the wind beneath my wings, [CT_NAME]!	
CIV4DiplomacyText.xml	AI_DIPLO_THANKS_25	You have our gratitude.	
CIV4DiplomacyText.xml	AI_DIPLO_THANKS_26	Many thanks, [CT_NAME]!	
CIV4DiplomacyText.xml	AI_DIPLO_THANKS_27	Many thanks. 	
CIV4DiplomacyText.xml	AI_DIPLO_THANKS_28	May the heavens bless and sanctify the friendship between our two great people!	
CIV4DiplomacyText.xml	AI_DIPLO_THANKS_29	May the bond between [OUR_NAME] and [CT_NAME] grow ever stronger!.	
CIV4DiplomacyText.xml	AI_DIPLO_THANKS_30	May the friendship between [OUR_CIV_SHORT] and [CT_CIV_SHORT] last for many years!	
CIV4DiplomacyText.xml	AI_DIPLO_THANKS_31	Did you ever know that you're my hero? You're everything I wish I could be. 	
CIV4DiplomacyText.xml	AI_DIPLO_THANKS_32	On behalf of the [OUR_CIV_ADJ] people, I thank you!	
CIV4DiplomacyText.xml	AI_DIPLO_THANKS_33	On behalf of the people of [OUR_CIV_SHORT], I thank you and all the [CT_CIV_ADJ] people.	
CIV4DiplomacyText.xml	AI_DIPLO_THANKS_34	Our work is concluded. You may go.	
CIV4DiplomacyText.xml	AI_DIPLO_THANKS_35	Our work is finished here, is it not? Well, then, don't let me keep you.	
CIV4DiplomacyText.xml	AI_DIPLO_THANKS_36	Thank me?  No, no...thank you, [CT_NAME]!	
CIV4DiplomacyText.xml	AI_DIPLO_THANKS_37	Thank you, [CT_NAME]! 	
CIV4DiplomacyText.xml	AI_DIPLO_THANKS_38	Thank you, [CT_NAME].	
CIV4DiplomacyText.xml	AI_DIPLO_THANKS_39	Thank you, [CT_NAME].  Is there anything else?	
CIV4DiplomacyText.xml	AI_DIPLO_THANKS_40	Thank you, [CT_NAME]. May both our people profit from our continued friendship!	
CIV4DiplomacyText.xml	AI_DIPLO_THANKS_41	Thank you.  Your cooperation has been noted.	
CIV4DiplomacyText.xml	AI_DIPLO_THANKS_42	Thanks, [CT_NAME].	
CIV4DiplomacyText.xml	AI_DIPLO_THANKS_43	It's been a small slice of heaven. I mean that sincerely.	
CIV4DiplomacyText.xml	AI_DIPLO_THANKS_44	Thanks.  Will that be all?	
CIV4DiplomacyText.xml	AI_DIPLO_THANKS_45	You have our gratitude.	
CIV4DiplomacyText.xml	AI_DIPLO_THANKS_46	That will be all for now, [CT_NAME].	
CIV4DiplomacyText.xml	AI_DIPLO_THANKS_47	There. That's a job well done, don't you think?	
CIV4DiplomacyText.xml	AI_DIPLO_THANKS_48	That's done, then. Thanks and farewell!	
CIV4DiplomacyText.xml	AI_DIPLO_THANKS_49	The [OUR_CIV_ADJ] people graciously thank the people of - whatever your culture's name is.	
CIV4DiplomacyText.xml	AI_DIPLO_THANKS_50	The [OUR_EMPIRE] thanks you, [CT_NAME]. You may go now.	
CIV4DiplomacyText.xml	AI_DIPLO_THANKS_51	We thank our friends and partners, the [CT_CIV_ADJ] people!	
CIV4DiplomacyText.xml	AI_DIPLO_THANKS_52	We thank our partner, [CT_CIV_SHORT], for coming to a fair and just agreement.	
CIV4DiplomacyText.xml	AI_DIPLO_THANKS_53	We work together well, [CT_NAME]. I look forward to many more mutually profitable arrangements in the future!	
CIV4DiplomacyText.xml	AI_DIPLO_THANKS_54	We're done here, right? Well, don't let me keep you. Thanks and good bye.	
CIV4DiplomacyText.xml	AI_DIPLO_THANKS_55	Yes, I believe we will both profit from this deal.  I look forward to doing business with you again.	
CIV4DiplomacyText.xml	AI_DIPLO_THANKS_56	You are almost an equal in cunning and martial prowess, [CT_NAME]. I, [OUR_NAME], thank you for your visit.	
CIV4DiplomacyText.xml	AI_DIPLO_THANKS_57	You are wise beyond your years, friend [CT_NAME]. [OUR_CIV_SHORT] offers you its sincerest thanks.	
CIV4DiplomacyText.xml	AI_DIPLO_THANKS_58	You have [OUR_CIV_SHORT]'s thanks.	
CIV4DiplomacyText.xml	AI_DIPLO_THANKS_59	You have chosen wisely, [CT_NAME]. It is important to maintain good relations with your betters, don't you agree?	
CIV4DiplomacyText.xml	AI_DIPLO_THANKS_60	You have my eternal gratitude, [CT_NAME].	
CIV4DiplomacyText.xml	AI_DIPLO_THANKS_61	You have our gratitude.	
CIV4DiplomacyText.xml	AI_DIPLO_THANKS_62	You have our thanks.	
CIV4DiplomacyText.xml	AI_DIPLO_THANKS_63	You make me so happy, [CT_NAME]!	
CIV4DiplomacyText.xml	AI_DIPLO_THANKS_64	You show great wisdom and acumen in picking your friends, [CT_NAME]. The [OUR_EMPIRE] thanks you.	
CIV4DiplomacyText.xml	AI_DIPLO_THANKS_65	You show great wisdom and friendship. [OUR_CIV_SHORT] thanks you!	
CIV4DiplomacyText.xml	AI_DIPLO_THANKS_66	Your fair and courteous dealings with the [OUR_CIV_ADJ] people will not be forgotten.	
CIV4DiplomacyText.xml	AI_DIPLO_THANKS_67	You have [OUR_CIV_SHORT]'s thanks.	
CIV4DiplomacyText.xml	AI_DIPLO_THANKS_68	It appears that your visit was not a complete waste. Come back again when you have something else to offer the [OUR_EMPIRE].	
CIV4DiplomacyText.xml	AI_DIPLO_THANKS_69	Yours is a friendly and accommodating little culture. We thank you.	
CIV4DiplomacyText.xml	AI_DIPLO_CURRENT_DEALS_1	As I see it, these are our current deals.	
CIV4DiplomacyText.xml	AI_DIPLO_CURRENT_DEALS_2	These are our active deals.	
CIV4DiplomacyText.xml	AI_DIPLO_CURRENT_DEALS_3	[CT_NAME], these are the deals we have agreed upon.	
CIV4DiplomacyText.xml	AI_DIPLO_CURRENT_DEALS_4	These are the deals we have with the [CT_EMPIRE].	
CIV4DiplomacyText.xml	AI_DIPLO_ACCEPT_ASK_1	Always happy to help...	
CIV4DiplomacyText.xml	AI_DIPLO_REJECT_ASK_1	Sorry, but you press us too hard.	
CIV4DiplomacyText.xml	AI_DIPLO_ACCEPT_DEMAND_1	We accede to your unreasonable demands.	
CIV4DiplomacyText.xml	AI_DIPLO_ACCEPT_DEMAND_2	I accept your terms, for now. But you just wait until next time!	
CIV4DiplomacyText.xml	AI_DIPLO_ACCEPT_DEMAND_3	It appears that I have no choice but to agree.	
CIV4DiplomacyText.xml	AI_DIPLO_ACCEPT_DEMAND_4	All right, then. But just remember: what goes around comes around!	
CIV4DiplomacyText.xml	AI_DIPLO_ACCEPT_DEMAND_5	Sure: kick a civilization when it's down. I accept your terms.	
CIV4DiplomacyText.xml	AI_DIPLO_ACCEPT_DEMAND_6	I agree to your terms. For now.	
CIV4DiplomacyText.xml	AI_DIPLO_ACCEPT_DEMAND_TEAM_1	Always happy to help!	
CIV4DiplomacyText.xml	AI_DIPLO_REJECT_DEMAND_1	We reject your meaningless threats!	
CIV4DiplomacyText.xml	AI_DIPLO_REJECT_DEMAND_2	How dare you insult glorious [OUR_CIV_SHORT] with your stupid demands!	
CIV4DiplomacyText.xml	AI_DIPLO_REJECT_DEMAND_3	Not bloody likely.	
CIV4DiplomacyText.xml	AI_DIPLO_REJECT_DEMAND_4	Not on my watch!	
CIV4DiplomacyText.xml	AI_DIPLO_REJECT_DEMAND_5	Never!	
CIV4DiplomacyText.xml	AI_DIPLO_REJECT_DEMAND_6	You badly underestimate the [OUR_EMPIRE], [CT_NAME]. We would never agree to any such thing.	
CIV4DiplomacyText.xml	AI_DIPLO_GIVE_HELP_1	We see that you could probably use a little help.	
CIV4DiplomacyText.xml	AI_DIPLO_GIVE_HELP_2	Perhaps this could be of assistance to you, [CT_NAME].	
CIV4DiplomacyText.xml	AI_DIPLO_GIVE_HELP_3	Here's a little something from us to you.	
CIV4DiplomacyText.xml	AI_DIPLO_GIVE_HELP_4	Here, my friend: you might need this.	
CIV4DiplomacyText.xml	AI_DIPLO_GIVE_HELP_5	Would this be of any use to you, [CT_NAME]?	
CIV4DiplomacyText.xml	AI_DIPLO_GIVE_HELP_6	The [OUR_CIV_ADJ] people are feeling quite generous today, [CT_NAME]. Perhaps this could be of some use to you.	
CIV4DiplomacyText.xml	AI_DIPLO_FR_ASK_FOR_HELP_1	Charity begins at home, [CT_NAME]. Care to give us some?	
CIV4DiplomacyText.xml	AI_DIPLO_FR_ASK_FOR_HELP_2	[OUR_CIV_SHORT] requires your assistance, friend [CT_NAME]. I hope that you will not disappoint us.	
CIV4DiplomacyText.xml	AI_DIPLO_FR_ASK_FOR_HELP_3	I have always relied on the kindness of strangers, [CT_NAME]. Can you help?	
CIV4DiplomacyText.xml	AI_DIPLO_FR_ASK_FOR_HELP_4	A friend in need is a friend indeed, [CT_NAME]. Care to help us out?	
CIV4DiplomacyText.xml	AI_DIPLO_FR_ASK_FOR_HELP_5	[OUR_CIV_SHORT] could use your assistance, [CT_NAME]. 	
CIV4DiplomacyText.xml	AI_DIPLO_FR_ASK_FOR_HELP_6	Could you possibly spare us this, [CT_NAME]?	
CIV4DiplomacyText.xml	AI_DIPLO_FUR_ASK_FOR_HELP_1	Supplying us with this would go a long way towards healing the unfortunate rift between our peoples, [CT_NAME]. 	
CIV4DiplomacyText.xml	AI_DIPLO_FUR_ASK_FOR_HELP_2	I find that [OUR_CIV_SHORT] needs your aid, [CT_NAME]. I'm certain you won't disappoint us.	
CIV4DiplomacyText.xml	AI_DIPLO_FUR_ASK_FOR_HELP_3	As difficult as it may be to believe, you actually have something that we could use.	
CIV4DiplomacyText.xml	AI_DIPLO_FUR_ASK_FOR_HELP_4	Your assistance at this vital time will do much towards regaining [OUR_CIV_SHORT]'s friendship, [CT_NAME].	
CIV4DiplomacyText.xml	AI_DIPLO_FUR_ASK_FOR_HELP_5	Despite our differences, I believe that our two nations have much in common. For example, you have this and we need it.	
CIV4DiplomacyText.xml	AI_DIPLO_FUR_ASK_FOR_HELP_6	We could use your assistance, [CT_NAME]. Do not disappoint us.	
CIV4DiplomacyText.xml	AI_DIPLO_HELP_REFUSED_WEAKER_1	How disappointing. 	
CIV4DiplomacyText.xml	AI_DIPLO_HELP_REFUSED_WEAKER_2	Well, dang.	
CIV4DiplomacyText.xml	AI_DIPLO_HELP_REFUSED_WEAKER_3	You are really not a very giving person, [CT_NAME].	
CIV4DiplomacyText.xml	AI_DIPLO_HELP_REFUSED_WEAKER_4	Very well. We shall say nothing more of this - for the moment.	
CIV4DiplomacyText.xml	AI_DIPLO_HELP_REFUSED_WEAKER_5	You have chosen foolishly, [CT_NAME].	
CIV4DiplomacyText.xml	AI_DIPLO_HELP_REFUSED_WEAKER_6	Very well. But greed will be your ultimate downfall, [CT_NAME]. 	
CIV4DiplomacyText.xml	AI_DIPLO_HELP_REFUSED_EQUAL_1	We shall remember this, [CT_NAME].	
CIV4DiplomacyText.xml	AI_DIPLO_HELP_REFUSED_EQUAL_2	How shortsighted of you.	
CIV4DiplomacyText.xml	AI_DIPLO_HELP_REFUSED_EQUAL_3	That's not very nice of you, [CT_NAME]. 	
CIV4DiplomacyText.xml	AI_DIPLO_HELP_REFUSED_EQUAL_4	We'll remember this.	
CIV4DiplomacyText.xml	AI_DIPLO_HELP_REFUSED_EQUAL_5	You foolish person.	
CIV4DiplomacyText.xml	AI_DIPLO_HELP_REFUSED_EQUAL_6	I expected better of you, [CT_NAME]. 	
CIV4DiplomacyText.xml	AI_DIPLO_HELP_REFUSED_STRONGER_1	I hope you don't come to regret this, [CT_NAME]. 	
CIV4DiplomacyText.xml	AI_DIPLO_HELP_REFUSED_STRONGER_2	Very well. On your own head be it.	
CIV4DiplomacyText.xml	AI_DIPLO_HELP_REFUSED_STRONGER_3	As you will. 	
CIV4DiplomacyText.xml	AI_DIPLO_HELP_REFUSED_STRONGER_4	Remember, what goes around comes around...	
CIV4DiplomacyText.xml	AI_DIPLO_HELP_REFUSED_STRONGER_5	Fine. See if we help you out when you need it.	
CIV4DiplomacyText.xml	AI_DIPLO_HELP_REFUSED_STRONGER_6	That's too bad. For the both of us, I fear.	
CIV4DiplomacyText.xml	AI_DIPLO_DEMAND_TRIBUTE_1	We demand the following in tribute!	
CIV4DiplomacyText.xml	AI_DIPLO_DEMAND_TRIBUTE_2	[CT_NAME], meet our demands or suffer the consequences.	
CIV4DiplomacyText.xml	AI_DIPLO_DEMAND_TRIBUTE_3	It would be wise for you to give us what we want.	
CIV4DiplomacyText.xml	AI_DIPLO_DEMAND_TRIBUTE_4	Give us what we want or prepare to be destroyed.	
CIV4DiplomacyText.xml	AI_DIPLO_DEMAND_TRIBUTE_5	Be wise [CT_NAME] and give in to our demands.	
CIV4DiplomacyText.xml	AI_DIPLO_DEMAND_TRIBUTE_POWER_WEAKER_1	We can do this the easy way, or the hard way. Which do you prefer?	
CIV4DiplomacyText.xml	AI_DIPLO_DEMAND_TRIBUTE_POWER_WEAKER_2	For the sake of our long friendship, [CT_NAME], will you not give us this small present?	
CIV4DiplomacyText.xml	AI_DIPLO_DEMAND_TRIBUTE_POWER_WEAKER_3	Friend [CT_NAME], we are in some need of assistance. Will you not help your longstanding friend and ally?	
CIV4DiplomacyText.xml	AI_DIPLO_DEMAND_TRIBUTE_POWER_WEAKER_4	Give us what we want, [CT_NAME], lest we come and take it.	
CIV4DiplomacyText.xml	AI_DIPLO_DEMAND_TRIBUTE_POWER_WEAKER_5	This is what we need, [CT_NAME]. Surely our continued friendship is worth far more than that!	
CIV4DiplomacyText.xml	AI_DIPLO_DEMAND_TRIBUTE_POWER_WEAKER_6	The [OUR_EMPIRE] would be quite grateful if your terribly vulnerable country gave us what we want.	
CIV4DiplomacyText.xml	AI_DIPLO_DEMAND_TRIBUTE_POWER_WEAKER_7	Our continued friendship provides many benefits, [CT_NAME]. Surely it is worth this small tribute in return?	
CIV4DiplomacyText.xml	AI_DIPLO_DEMAND_TRIBUTE_POWER_WEAKER_8	Pay it forward, [CT_NAME]. Please?	
CIV4DiplomacyText.xml	AI_DIPLO_DEMAND_TRIBUTE_POWER_WEAKER_FRANKLIN_ROOSEVELT_1	The only thing you have to fear is the terrible consequence of not giving me what I want.	
CIV4DiplomacyText.xml	AI_DIPLO_DEMAND_TRIBUTE_POWER_WEAKER_WASHINGTON_1	The best things in life are free, [CT_NAME]. Unfortunately, our continued friendship isn't one of them.	
CIV4DiplomacyText.xml	AI_DIPLO_DEMAND_TRIBUTE_POWER_WEAKER_MONTEZUMA_1	The gods demand sacrifice, [CT_NAME]. If your civilization is to exist for much longer, I recommend that you comply.	
CIV4DiplomacyText.xml	AI_DIPLO_DEMAND_TRIBUTE_POWER_WEAKER_QIN_SHI_HUANG_1	That's quite a nice little civilization you have going there, [CT_NAME]. It would be very unfortunate if something bad were to happen to it... We understand each other, do we not?	
CIV4DiplomacyText.xml	AI_DIPLO_DEMAND_TRIBUTE_POWER_WEAKER_CHINESE_LEADER_1	[CT_NAME], please give us the following immediately. Think of it as an investment in our continued friendship.	
CIV4DiplomacyText.xml	AI_DIPLO_DEMAND_TRIBUTE_POWER_WEAKER_MENES_1	I want this right now. Do not make me angry - you wouldn't like me when I'm angry...	
CIV4DiplomacyText.xml	AI_DIPLO_DEMAND_TRIBUTE_POWER_WEAKER_HATSHEPSUT_1	I was going to demand that you sacrifice 1000 warriors to my greatness, [CT_NAME], but if you prefer, you can give me this.	
CIV4DiplomacyText.xml	AI_DIPLO_DEMAND_TRIBUTE_POWER_WEAKER_ELIZABETH_1	The world is a better place because of our friendship, [CT_NAME]; don't you agree? Surely this isn't too large a price to pay to insure that it continues...	
CIV4DiplomacyText.xml	AI_DIPLO_DEMAND_TRIBUTE_POWER_WEAKER_VICTORIA_1	The [CT_CIV_ADJ] people are in great need, [CT_NAME]. Do not disappoint us.	
CIV4DiplomacyText.xml	AI_DIPLO_DEMAND_TRIBUTE_POWER_WEAKER_NAPOLEON_1	My armies thirst for new lands to conquer, [CT_NAME]. Would you care to ensure that they aren't yours?	
CIV4DiplomacyText.xml	AI_DIPLO_DEMAND_TRIBUTE_POWER_WEAKER_ALEXANDER_1	For the sake of our continued friendship, provide the great people of the [OUR_NAME] with tribute.	
CIV4DiplomacyText.xml	AI_DIPLO_DEMAND_TRIBUTE_POWER_WEAKER_HUAYNA_CAPAC_1	Give us what we want, [CT_NAME] - it is the will of the gods. 	
CIV4DiplomacyText.xml	AI_DIPLO_DEMAND_TRIBUTE_POWER_WEAKER_ASOKA_1	Peace demands sacrifice, [CT_NAME]. From you.	
CIV4DiplomacyText.xml	AI_DIPLO_DEMAND_TRIBUTE_POWER_WEAKER_GANDHI_1	I hope you see, [CT_NAME], that it is in your country's best interest to give us what we want. 	
CIV4DiplomacyText.xml	AI_DIPLO_DEMAND_TRIBUTE_POWER_WEAKER_TOKUGAWA_1	Give us what we want, now! Or face imminent destruction! 	
CIV4DiplomacyText.xml	AI_DIPLO_DEMAND_TRIBUTE_POWER_WEAKER_MANSA_MUSA_1	Forsake greed, friend!  Provide me with tribute, or risk the anger of the [OUR_CIV_ADJ] people.	
CIV4DiplomacyText.xml	AI_DIPLO_DEMAND_TRIBUTE_POWER_WEAKER_GENGHIS_KHAN_1	Bestow gifts upon your friends and you are likely to be rewarded a hundred times over.  Ignore the advice of wise-men, and you risk being flogged about the head, neck, face, and shoulders.	
CIV4DiplomacyText.xml	AI_DIPLO_DEMAND_TRIBUTE_POWER_WEAKER_KUBLAI_KHAN_1	The mighty [OUR_EMPIRE] thanks you for your generous gift, [CT_NAME]. Now hand it over.	
CIV4DiplomacyText.xml	AI_DIPLO_DEMAND_TRIBUTE_POWER_WEAKER_CYRUS_1	Friendly [OUR_CIV_SHORT] requires a goodwill gesture from our firm yet surprisingly vulnerable ally, [CT_CIV_SHORT]. 	
CIV4DiplomacyText.xml	AI_DIPLO_DEMAND_TRIBUTE_POWER_WEAKER_JULIUS_CAESAR_1	Usually, when I see something I want, I just come over and take it. Consider this your lucky day.	
CIV4DiplomacyText.xml	AI_DIPLO_DEMAND_TRIBUTE_POWER_WEAKER_AUGUSTUS_CAESAR_1	The truth is, [OUR_CIV_SHORT] is stronger than your empire, [CT_NAME]. It would be wise of you to give us what we want.	
CIV4DiplomacyText.xml	AI_DIPLO_DEMAND_TRIBUTE_POWER_WEAKER_PETER_1	Give us this or our mighty Cossacks will roam across your ravaged country, burning your cities, stealing your pigs and making lewd gestures at your women!	
CIV4DiplomacyText.xml	AI_DIPLO_DEMAND_TRIBUTE_POWER_WEAKER_CATHERINE_1	A present for me? Why, it's just what I wanted! How ever did you guess?	
CIV4DiplomacyText.xml	AI_DIPLO_DEMAND_TRIBUTE_POWER_WEAKER_ISABELLA_1	Heaven is on our side, [CT_NAME]. I pray that you know what's good for you.	
CIV4DiplomacyText.xml	AI_DIPLO_DEMAND_TRIBUTE_POWER_WEAKER_GILGAMESH_1	Give us what we want now, [CT_NAME], and we shall repay you a hundredfold at some distant later date.	
CIV4DiplomacyText.xml	AI_DIPLO_DEMAND_TRIBUTE_POWER_EQUAL_1	The honor of [OUR_CIV_SHORT] requires that we ask you to give us a small donation.	
CIV4DiplomacyText.xml	AI_DIPLO_DEMAND_TRIBUTE_POWER_EQUAL_2	For the sake of friendship, you might want to consider giving us a small gift.	
CIV4DiplomacyText.xml	AI_DIPLO_DEMAND_TRIBUTE_POWER_EQUAL_3	Agree to our demands, [CT_NAME], or be prepared to fight!	
CIV4DiplomacyText.xml	AI_DIPLO_DEMAND_TRIBUTE_POWER_EQUAL_4	Know that [OUR_CIV_SHORT] stands by [CT_CIV_SHORT]'s side as friend and equal Now - about our fee...	
CIV4DiplomacyText.xml	AI_DIPLO_DEMAND_TRIBUTE_POWER_EQUAL_5	Peace with the [OUR_EMPIRE] comes with a price, [CT_NAME]. Will you pay?	
CIV4DiplomacyText.xml	AI_DIPLO_DEMAND_TRIBUTE_POWER_EQUAL_6	[OUR_CIV_SHORT] demands that you give us the following tribute. Our [OUR_BEST_UNIT] await your response.	
CIV4DiplomacyText.xml	AI_DIPLO_DEMAND_TRIBUTE_POWER_EQUAL_7	[OUR_CIV_SHORT] needs this, [CT_NAME]. Will you give it to us, or must we fight for it?	
CIV4DiplomacyText.xml	AI_DIPLO_DEMAND_TRIBUTE_POWER_EQUAL_FRANKLIN_ROOSEVELT_1	Hello, [CT_NAME]! The price of freedom has just gone up.	
CIV4DiplomacyText.xml	AI_DIPLO_DEMAND_TRIBUTE_POWER_EQUAL_WASHINGTON_1	I cannot tell a lie, [CT_NAME]: we want your stuff. Kindly give it to us at your earliest convenience.	
CIV4DiplomacyText.xml	AI_DIPLO_DEMAND_TRIBUTE_POWER_EQUAL_SALADIN_1	By the glory of God, I, [OUR_NAME], mightiest of his servants, do request a small donation from you, [CT_NAME]. You would be wise to consider my request carefully.	
CIV4DiplomacyText.xml	AI_DIPLO_DEMAND_TRIBUTE_POWER_EQUAL_MONTEZUMA_1	The [OUR_EMPIRE] requests from you a small donation, [CT_NAME]. Or, if you prefer, we can battle until one of us is destroyed. 	
CIV4DiplomacyText.xml	AI_DIPLO_DEMAND_TRIBUTE_POWER_EQUAL_CHINESE_LEADER_1	Would you care to take part in our share-the-wealth program, [CT_NAME]?	
CIV4DiplomacyText.xml	AI_DIPLO_DEMAND_TRIBUTE_POWER_EQUAL_MENES_1	Furnish [OUR_CIV_SHORT] with these gifts and we will tolerate your existence for a little while longer.	
CIV4DiplomacyText.xml	AI_DIPLO_DEMAND_TRIBUTE_POWER_EQUAL_HATSHEPSUT_1	It is customary for puny mortals to show their devotion by giving their goddess a gift. Or if they prefer they can be cut into small pieces and fed to the royal crocodiles.	
CIV4DiplomacyText.xml	AI_DIPLO_DEMAND_TRIBUTE_POWER_EQUAL_ELIZABETH_1	My dear [CT_NAME], [OUR_CIV_SHORT] can make life very difficult indeed for [CT_CIV_SHORT]. Give us what we want or suffer the consequences.	
CIV4DiplomacyText.xml	AI_DIPLO_DEMAND_TRIBUTE_POWER_EQUAL_VICTORIA_1	We have needs, [CT_NAME]. Please comply.	
CIV4DiplomacyText.xml	AI_DIPLO_DEMAND_TRIBUTE_POWER_EQUAL_NAPOLEON_1	I'll keep this short: comply with our demands or suffer the consequences. That is all.	
CIV4DiplomacyText.xml	AI_DIPLO_DEMAND_TRIBUTE_POWER_EQUAL_BISMARCK_1	"Blackmail" is such an ugly word, [CT_NAME]. I prefer to call it, "extortion."	
CIV4DiplomacyText.xml	AI_DIPLO_DEMAND_TRIBUTE_POWER_EQUAL_ALEXANDER_1	Do you choose to cravenly lick our boots and give us what we want, or to stand and fight us in a heroic but doomed last stand?	
CIV4DiplomacyText.xml	AI_DIPLO_DEMAND_TRIBUTE_POWER_EQUAL_HUAYNA_CAPAC_1	I have sacrificed many foes, [CT_NAME]. Give me what I want or you may be next.	
CIV4DiplomacyText.xml	AI_DIPLO_DEMAND_TRIBUTE_POWER_EQUAL_ASOKA_1	A small donation would help insure continued frirendship between our two peoples, [CT_NAME]. 	
CIV4DiplomacyText.xml	AI_DIPLO_DEMAND_TRIBUTE_POWER_EQUAL_GANDHI_1	[OUR_CIV_SHORT] requests a small donation from their good friends, the [CT_CIV_ADJ] people. 	
CIV4DiplomacyText.xml	AI_DIPLO_DEMAND_TRIBUTE_POWER_EQUAL_TOKUGAWA_1	We are bigger and stronger than you, [CT_NAME]. You must give us tribute, or suffer the consequences.	
CIV4DiplomacyText.xml	AI_DIPLO_DEMAND_TRIBUTE_POWER_EQUAL_MANSA_MUSA_1	My generosity is known the world over, [CT_NAME]. How about yours?	
CIV4DiplomacyText.xml	AI_DIPLO_DEMAND_TRIBUTE_POWER_EQUAL_GENGHIS_KHAN_1	Give us what we want, [CT_NAME], or 20,000 screaming warriors will come and take it.	
CIV4DiplomacyText.xml	AI_DIPLO_DEMAND_TRIBUTE_POWER_EQUAL_KUBLAI_KHAN_1	You may purchase your continued existence with this, [CT_NAME]. I suggest that you be sensible and do so.	
CIV4DiplomacyText.xml	AI_DIPLO_DEMAND_TRIBUTE_POWER_EQUAL_JULIUS_CAESAR_1	If you wish to ensure [CT_CIV_SHORT]'s continued survival, you would be wise to comply with my demands.	
CIV4DiplomacyText.xml	AI_DIPLO_DEMAND_TRIBUTE_POWER_EQUAL_AUGUSTUS_CAESAR_1	The [CT_EMPIRE] is strong, [CT_NAME]. But are you sure that it is as strong as Mighty [OUR_CIV_SHORT]? Deny us our tribute and you may have a chance to find out.	
CIV4DiplomacyText.xml	AI_DIPLO_DEMAND_TRIBUTE_POWER_EQUAL_PETER_1	Hand this over or die.	
CIV4DiplomacyText.xml	AI_DIPLO_DEMAND_TRIBUTE_POWER_EQUAL_CATHERINE_1	I do so hope that we can remain friends, [CT_NAME]. The world just wouldn't be as much fun with you not in it.	
CIV4DiplomacyText.xml	AI_DIPLO_DEMAND_TRIBUTE_POWER_EQUAL_ISABELLA_1	Mighty [OUR_CIV_SHORT] is leading the battle against evil, godless, heathen, barbarians, [CT_NAME]. It is time to show your appreciation. 	
CIV4DiplomacyText.xml	AI_DIPLO_DEMAND_TRIBUTE_POWER_EQUAL_GILGAMESH_1	Given the many concessions we have granted you previously, is it not time for you to give Mighty [OUR_CIV_SHORT] something in return?	
CIV4DiplomacyText.xml	AI_DIPLO_DEMAND_TRIBUTE_POWER_STRONGER_1	Think well, [CT_NAME]: if you give us tribute, our friendship will continue. If not, we will have to seriously re-evaluate our relationship.	
CIV4DiplomacyText.xml	AI_DIPLO_DEMAND_TRIBUTE_POWER_STRONGER_2	[OUR_CIV_SHORT] demands that you pay her tribute.	
CIV4DiplomacyText.xml	AI_DIPLO_DEMAND_TRIBUTE_POWER_STRONGER_3	Give us what we want or be destroyed.	
CIV4DiplomacyText.xml	AI_DIPLO_DEMAND_TRIBUTE_POWER_STRONGER_4	Mighty [OUR_CIV_SHORT] demands that you acknowledge her superiority with a small token of respect.	
CIV4DiplomacyText.xml	AI_DIPLO_DEMAND_TRIBUTE_POWER_STRONGER_5	The superior [OUR_CIV_ADJ] civilization is worthy of tribute. Dispense goods to us, and we'll refrain from sending our [OUR_BEST_UNIT] to crush you.	
CIV4DiplomacyText.xml	AI_DIPLO_DEMAND_TRIBUTE_POWER_STRONGER_6	Time is short and so too will be the memory of [CT_CIV_SHORT] should you deny me this token of respect.	
CIV4DiplomacyText.xml	AI_DIPLO_DEMAND_TRIBUTE_POWER_STRONGER_7	I wonder if you would consider giving us a small gift, [CT_NAME], in honor of the timeless friendship between Mighty [OUR_CIV_SHORT] and your weak and defenseless people?	
CIV4DiplomacyText.xml	AI_DIPLO_DEMAND_TRIBUTE_POWER_STRONGER_8	For the sake of your country's continued survival, I suggest that you comply with our demands.	
CIV4DiplomacyText.xml	AI_DIPLO_DEMAND_TRIBUTE_POWER_STRONGER_FRANKLIN_ROOSEVELT_1	That certainly is a nice little civilization you have there, [CT_NAME]. It would be unfortunate if something were to happen to it...	
CIV4DiplomacyText.xml	AI_DIPLO_DEMAND_TRIBUTE_POWER_STRONGER_WASHINGTON_1	Don't think of this as a demand for tribute, [CT_NAME]. Think of it as an investment in world peace.	
CIV4DiplomacyText.xml	AI_DIPLO_DEMAND_TRIBUTE_POWER_STRONGER_SALADIN_1	It is only proper that the vassal states provide tribute to their lord and protector. That would be me.	
CIV4DiplomacyText.xml	AI_DIPLO_DEMAND_TRIBUTE_POWER_STRONGER_MONTEZUMA_1	Your weakness is contemptible, #CT_NAME! Give us what we want or perish!	
CIV4DiplomacyText.xml	AI_DIPLO_DEMAND_TRIBUTE_POWER_STRONGER_QIN_SHI_HUANG_1	If you wish your pathetic civilization to survive, [CT_NAME], you had better comply with our demands!	
CIV4DiplomacyText.xml	AI_DIPLO_DEMAND_TRIBUTE_POWER_STRONGER_CHINESE_LEADER_1	For too long have the glorious [CT_CIV_ADJ] workers put up with your contemptible bourgoise insolence! It's time for an immediate redistribution of wealth!	
CIV4DiplomacyText.xml	AI_DIPLO_DEMAND_TRIBUTE_POWER_STRONGER_MENES_1	Glorious [OUR_CIV_SHORT] requires from you a token of aubmission. Or would you prefer that we wipe [CT_CIV_SHORT] from the face of the planet?	
CIV4DiplomacyText.xml	AI_DIPLO_DEMAND_TRIBUTE_POWER_STRONGER_ELIZABETH_1	Conventional wisdom suggests that you bequeath certain goods to us or be destroyed.	
CIV4DiplomacyText.xml	AI_DIPLO_DEMAND_TRIBUTE_POWER_STRONGER_VICTORIA_1	Give [OUR_CIV_SHORT] what is due her, [CT_NAME]! We shall not ask a second time.	
CIV4DiplomacyText.xml	AI_DIPLO_DEMAND_TRIBUTE_POWER_STRONGER_LOUIS_XIV	The [OUR_CIV_ADJ] Folk have put up with your insults long enough! Pay us the following or suffer the consequences!	
CIV4DiplomacyText.xml	AI_DIPLO_DEMAND_TRIBUTE_POWER_STRONGER_NAPOLEON_1	If you wish to delay your destruction, [CT_NAME], give us what we want.	
CIV4DiplomacyText.xml	AI_DIPLO_DEMAND_TRIBUTE_POWER_STRONGER_BISMARCK_1	To be honest, raw greed is the only thing stopping us from destroying your puny civilization. Pay us what we want, or perish.	
CIV4DiplomacyText.xml	AI_DIPLO_DEMAND_TRIBUTE_POWER_STRONGER_HUAYNA_CAPAC_1	Foolish [CT_NAME]! Give us what we want and you may live for yet another day!	
CIV4DiplomacyText.xml	AI_DIPLO_DEMAND_TRIBUTE_POWER_STRONGER_ASOKA_1	Mighty [OUR_CIV_SHORT]'s protection comes at a price, [CT_NAME]. You would be wise to pay it.	
CIV4DiplomacyText.xml	AI_DIPLO_DEMAND_TRIBUTE_POWER_STRONGER_GANDHI_1	I believe in peace at any price, [CT_NAME]. This is your price.	
CIV4DiplomacyText.xml	AI_DIPLO_DEMAND_TRIBUTE_POWER_STRONGER_TOKUGAWA_1	Do not let foolish pride cause the downfall of your people, [CT_NAME]. Pay us what we want - or be destroyed!	
CIV4DiplomacyText.xml	AI_DIPLO_DEMAND_TRIBUTE_POWER_STRONGER_MANSA_MUSA_1	Time is short and so too will be the memory of [CT_CIV_SHORT] should you deny me this token of respect.	
CIV4DiplomacyText.xml	AI_DIPLO_DEMAND_TRIBUTE_POWER_STRONGER_GENGHIS_KHAN_1	When you find a hungry tiger at your door, commen sense says that you feed him.	
CIV4DiplomacyText.xml	AI_DIPLO_DEMAND_TRIBUTE_POWER_STRONGER_KUBLAI_KHAN_1	[OUR_CIV_SHORT] requires tribute from inferior cultures such as yours. Comply or be destroyed.	
CIV4DiplomacyText.xml	AI_DIPLO_DEMAND_TRIBUTE_POWER_STRONGER_JULIUS_CAESAR_1	Acceed to our demands or face us in battle. 	
CIV4DiplomacyText.xml	AI_DIPLO_DEMAND_TRIBUTE_POWER_STRONGER_AUGUSTUS_CAESAR_1	Resistance is futile! Comply with our demands or face destruction!	
CIV4DiplomacyText.xml	AI_DIPLO_DEMAND_TRIBUTE_POWER_STRONGER_PETER_1	Ah, [CT_NAME]. I have an excellent deal to offer you: give us what we want, and we will not crush you. Does that not sound fair?	
CIV4DiplomacyText.xml	AI_DIPLO_DEMAND_TRIBUTE_POWER_STRONGER_CATHERINE_1	Some enjoy licking our boots, [CT_NAME]. How about you give it a try?	
CIV4DiplomacyText.xml	AI_DIPLO_DEMAND_TRIBUTE_POWER_STRONGER_GILGAMESH_1	Your ruination is at hand, [CT_NAME]! Your only chance of survival is to give mighty [OUR_CIV_SHORT] what she wants!	
CIV4DiplomacyText.xml	AI_DIPLO_DEMAND_REJECTED_POWER_WEAKER_1	Very well. I hope that you won't come to regret this decision, [CT_NAME].	
CIV4DiplomacyText.xml	AI_DIPLO_DEMAND_REJECTED_POWER_WEAKER_2	In the future you'd best remember who your friends are, [CT_NAME].	
CIV4DiplomacyText.xml	AI_DIPLO_DEMAND_REJECTED_POWER_WEAKER_3	Once again you disappoint me, [CT_NAME]. You'd be advised to see that it doesn't happen again.	
CIV4DiplomacyText.xml	AI_DIPLO_DEMAND_REJECTED_POWER_WEAKER_4	Well that's not very nice, if you ask me.	
CIV4DiplomacyText.xml	AI_DIPLO_DEMAND_REJECTED_POWER_WEAKER_5	Curses: foiled again!	
CIV4DiplomacyText.xml	AI_DIPLO_DEMAND_REJECTED_POWER_WEAKER_6	You are arrogant, [CT_NAME]. Some day it will lead to your destruction. 	
CIV4DiplomacyText.xml	AI_DIPLO_DEMAND_REJECTED_POWER_EQUAL_1	Foolish stubborness will lead to your destruction, [CT_NAME].	
CIV4DiplomacyText.xml	AI_DIPLO_DEMAND_REJECTED_POWER_EQUAL_2	Very well. On your head be it.	
CIV4DiplomacyText.xml	AI_DIPLO_DEMAND_REJECTED_POWER_EQUAL_3	I don't think you realize just who you're dealing with, [CT_NAME]. I suggest you reconsider, and quickly!	
CIV4DiplomacyText.xml	AI_DIPLO_DEMAND_REJECTED_POWER_EQUAL_4	You gamble with the lives of your people, [CT_NAME]. Are you ready to pay the price if you lose?	
CIV4DiplomacyText.xml	AI_DIPLO_DEMAND_REJECTED_POWER_EQUAL_5	Fine. Next time I won't ask so nicely!	
CIV4DiplomacyText.xml	AI_DIPLO_DEMAND_REJECTED_POWER_EQUAL_6	You're playing with fire, [CT_NAME]. See that you don't get burned.	
CIV4DiplomacyText.xml	AI_DIPLO_DEMAND_REJECTED_POWER_STRONGER_1	You'll regret this, you wretched creature!	
CIV4DiplomacyText.xml	AI_DIPLO_DEMAND_REJECTED_POWER_STRONGER_2	You test my patience, [CT_NAME]!	
CIV4DiplomacyText.xml	AI_DIPLO_DEMAND_REJECTED_POWER_STRONGER_3	Very well. I suggest that you start cranking out those soldiers, [CT_NAME]. You'll have need of them shortly.	
CIV4DiplomacyText.xml	AI_DIPLO_DEMAND_REJECTED_POWER_STRONGER_4	You should think more carefully before you anger your betters, [CT_NAME], for it can lead to bitter consequences.	
CIV4DiplomacyText.xml	AI_DIPLO_DEMAND_REJECTED_POWER_STRONGER_5	Fool! Don't you know that I could crush you like a grape?	
CIV4DiplomacyText.xml	AI_DIPLO_DEMAND_REJECTED_POWER_STRONGER_6	How dare you deny my extremely reasonable request! You'll regret this, I promise!	
CIV4DiplomacyText.xml	AI_DIPLO_RELIGION_PRESSURE_WEAKER_1	The bonds between our civilizations would be greatly strengthened if you converted to [OUR_STATE_RELIGION].	
CIV4DiplomacyText.xml	AI_DIPLO_RELIGION_PRESSURE_WEAKER_2	Isn't it about time that you abandoned your foolish beliefs and converted to [OUR_STATE_RELIGION], [CT_NAME]?	
CIV4DiplomacyText.xml	AI_DIPLO_RELIGION_PRESSURE_WEAKER_3	You should consider converting to [OUR_STATE_RELIGION], [CT_NAME]. It is the one true path to salvation.	
CIV4DiplomacyText.xml	AI_DIPLO_RELIGION_PRESSURE_EQUAL_1	I urge you to convert to [OUR_STATE_RELIGION], [CT_NAME]. Religious wars can be so unpleasant...	
CIV4DiplomacyText.xml	AI_DIPLO_RELIGION_PRESSURE_EQUAL_2	Our gods can beat your gods any day of the week, [CT_NAME]. Convert to [OUR_STATE_RELIGION] before it's too late!	
CIV4DiplomacyText.xml	AI_DIPLO_RELIGION_PRESSURE_EQUAL_3	[OUR_STATE_RELIGION] is mighty, [CT_NAME]. Convert now, before the heavens rain their displeasure upon you.	
CIV4DiplomacyText.xml	AI_DIPLO_RELIGION_PRESSURE_STRONGER_1	The heavens demand that you join [OUR_STATE_RELIGION] immediately. Consider your answer carefully!	
CIV4DiplomacyText.xml	AI_DIPLO_RELIGION_PRESSURE_STRONGER_2	Abandon your heathenish ways and join [OUR_STATE_RELIGION], [CT_NAME]. Your people's survival depends on it!	
CIV4DiplomacyText.xml	AI_DIPLO_RELIGION_PRESSURE_STRONGER_3	Discard your false religion and embrace [OUR_STATE_RELIGION], [CT_NAME]. If you wish to survive...	
CIV4DiplomacyText.xml	AI_DIPLO_RELIGION_DENIED_WEAKER_1	Very well. We know that this can be a sensitive matter.	
CIV4DiplomacyText.xml	AI_DIPLO_RELIGION_DENIED_WEAKER_2	As you wish. 	
CIV4DiplomacyText.xml	AI_DIPLO_RELIGION_DENIED_WEAKER_3	We shall speak of this again at a later time.	
CIV4DiplomacyText.xml	AI_DIPLO_RELIGION_DENIED_EQUAL_1	On your own head be it.	
CIV4DiplomacyText.xml	AI_DIPLO_RELIGION_DENIED_EQUAL_2	You disappoint me. And you disappoint the heavens. Foolish.	
CIV4DiplomacyText.xml	AI_DIPLO_RELIGION_DENIED_EQUAL_3	Very well. But remember, [CT_NAME], The wages of sin are death. 	
CIV4DiplomacyText.xml	AI_DIPLO_RELIGION_DENIED_STRONGER_1	So be it. I pray that your people do not suffer overmuch for your folly.	
CIV4DiplomacyText.xml	AI_DIPLO_RELIGION_DENIED_STRONGER_2	You mock the heavens at your peril, [CT_NAME]! I can but hope that you will see wisdom before it is too late.	
CIV4DiplomacyText.xml	AI_DIPLO_RELIGION_DENIED_STRONGER_3	I fear that your blasphemy will not go unpunished, [CT_NAME]. I'd invest in a lot of lightning rods if I were you.	
CIV4DiplomacyText.xml	AI_DIPLO_CIVIC_PRESSURE_1	Please join us by adopting %s1.	
CIV4DiplomacyText.xml	AI_DIPLO_CIVIC_PRESSURE_2	All the cool civs are adopting %s1, [CT_NAME]. How about you?	
CIV4DiplomacyText.xml	AI_DIPLO_CIVIC_PRESSURE_3	Have you considered adopting %s1? it will bring our two civilizations even closer together.	
CIV4DiplomacyText.xml	AI_DIPLO_CIVIC_PRESSURE_4	I urge you to adopt %s1, [CT_NAME]. Your civilization will be the better for it.	
CIV4DiplomacyText.xml	AI_DIPLO_CIVIC_PRESSURE_5	%s1 is extremely useful, [CT_NAME]. [CT_CIV_SHORT] would do well to adopt it.	
CIV4DiplomacyText.xml	AI_DIPLO_CIVIC_PRESSURE_16	Adopt %s1 - before it's too late!	
CIV4DiplomacyText.xml	AI_DIPLO_CIVIC_DENIED_1	As you will.	
CIV4DiplomacyText.xml	AI_DIPLO_CIVIC_DENIED_2	I suppose you know best. 	
CIV4DiplomacyText.xml	AI_DIPLO_CIVIC_DENIED_3	On your head be it.	
CIV4DiplomacyText.xml	AI_DIPLO_CIVIC_DENIED_4	Really? How foolish.	
CIV4DiplomacyText.xml	AI_DIPLO_CIVIC_DENIED_5	That's not very intelligent of you, [CT_NAME].	
CIV4DiplomacyText.xml	AI_DIPLO_CIVIC_DENIED_6	Nobody ever listens to me.	
CIV4DiplomacyText.xml	AI_DIPLO_JOIN_WAR_1	%s2 is a threat to us all. Please join us in wiping [NUM2:him:her:them:them] out.	
CIV4DiplomacyText.xml	AI_DIPLO_JOIN_WAR_2	Care to assist us in destroying the evil %s2?	
CIV4DiplomacyText.xml	AI_DIPLO_JOIN_WAR_3	Greetings, [CT_NAME]. The annoying %s2 must be destroyed, don't you agree?	
CIV4DiplomacyText.xml	AI_DIPLO_JOIN_WAR_4	[CT_NAME]: we urgently request mighty [CT_CIV_SHORT]'s assistance in our crusade against %s2!	
CIV4DiplomacyText.xml	AI_DIPLO_JOIN_WAR_5	The treacherous %s2 must be punished for [NUM2:his:her:their:their] offences against civilization, [CT_NAME]! I assume we can count on your assistance?	
CIV4DiplomacyText.xml	AI_DIPLO_JOIN_WAR_6	The nasty %s2 are plotting against us all, [CT_NAME]! Let us destroy [NUM2:him:her:them:them] together!	
CIV4DiplomacyText.xml	AI_DIPLO_JOIN_DENIED_1	You should choose your sides carefully.	
CIV4DiplomacyText.xml	AI_DIPLO_JOIN_DENIED_2	Very well. That just means more plunder for us!	
CIV4DiplomacyText.xml	AI_DIPLO_JOIN_DENIED_3	Really? I had no idea you were so timid!	
CIV4DiplomacyText.xml	AI_DIPLO_JOIN_DENIED_4	How very disappointing.	
CIV4DiplomacyText.xml	AI_DIPLO_JOIN_DENIED_5	I hope you know what you're doing, [CT_NAME].	
CIV4DiplomacyText.xml	AI_DIPLO_JOIN_DENIED_6	We shall remember this, [CT_NAME]!	
CIV4DiplomacyText.xml	AI_DIPLO_STOP_TRADING_1	It can no longer be tolerated - we demand that you cancel your deals with the vile %s2!	
CIV4DiplomacyText.xml	AI_DIPLO_STOP_DENIED_1	We won't take this lightly, [CT_NAME]!	
CIV4DiplomacyText.xml	AI_DIPLO_UNIT_BRAG_1	Fear my [OUR_BEST_UNIT]!	
CIV4DiplomacyText.xml	AI_DIPLO_UNIT_BRAG_2	Soon my numberless [OUR_BEST_UNIT] shall destroy you all!	
CIV4DiplomacyText.xml	AI_DIPLO_UNIT_BRAG_3	Now I have a [OUR_BEST_UNIT]. Ho-Ho-Ho.	
CIV4DiplomacyText.xml	AI_DIPLO_UNIT_BRAG_4	Oh look: I've just built a [OUR_BEST_UNIT]. Now where shall I put it?	
CIV4DiplomacyText.xml	AI_DIPLO_UNIT_BRAG_5	Cower before the might of my [OUR_BEST_UNIT]!	
CIV4DiplomacyText.xml	AI_DIPLO_NUKES_1	Beware, our words are backed by nuclear weapons!	
CIV4DiplomacyText.xml	AI_DIPLO_WORST_ENEMY_1	Watch out for our worst enemy - [OUR_WORST_ENEMY]! They can't be trusted.	
CIV4DiplomacyText.xml	AI_DIPLO_WORST_ENEMY_TRADING_1	We would encourage you to stop trading with our bitter enemy - [OUR_WORST_ENEMY]!	
CIV4DiplomacyText.xml	AI_DIPLO_SOMETHING_ELSE_1	What else would you like to discuss?	
CIV4DiplomacyText.xml	AI_DIPLO_RESEARCH_1	What would you like us to research?	
CIV4DiplomacyText.xml	AI_DIPLO_RESEARCH_TECH_1	We'll switch right away!	
CIV4DiplomacyText.xml	AI_DIPLO_ATTITUDE_1	Yes?	
CIV4DiplomacyText.xml	AI_DIPLO_TARGET_1	Where should we attack?	
CIV4DiplomacyText.xml	AI_DIPLO_TARGET_CITY_1	We'll do our best!	
CIV4DiplomacyText.xml	AI_DIPLO_WELL_1	Well?	
CIV4DiplomacyText.xml	USER_DIPLO_WAR_RESPONSE_1	So be it.	
CIV4DiplomacyText.xml	USER_DIPLO_PEACE_1	There shall be peace in our time!	
CIV4DiplomacyText.xml	USER_DIPLO_WAR_1	Your head would look good on the end of a pole. (WAR)	
CIV4DiplomacyText.xml	USER_DIPLO_PROPOSE_1	Would you accept this deal?	
CIV4DiplomacyText.xml	USER_DIPLO_ACCEPT_1	We accept your offer.	
CIV4DiplomacyText.xml	USER_DIPLO_REJECT_1	Sorry, we cannot accept such a deal.	
CIV4DiplomacyText.xml	USER_DIPLO_OFFER_1	What do you want for this?	
CIV4DiplomacyText.xml	USER_DIPLO_GIFT_1	Please, accept this gift.	
CIV4DiplomacyText.xml	USER_DIPLO_NEVERMIND_1	Never mind...	
CIV4DiplomacyText.xml	USER_DIPLO_PROPOSAL_1	We would like to make a trade proposal.	
CIV4DiplomacyText.xml	USER_DIPLO_COMPLETE_DEAL_1	What would make this deal work?	
CIV4DiplomacyText.xml	USER_DIPLO_FISH_FOR_DEAL_1	What will you give me for this?	
CIV4DiplomacyText.xml	USER_DIPLO_SUGGEST_PEACE_1	Lets stop this pointless fighting and declare peace!	
CIV4DiplomacyText.xml	USER_DIPLO_OFFER_PEACE_1	Let us bury the hatchet. What is the price for peace?	
CIV4DiplomacyText.xml	USER_DIPLO_CURRENT_DEALS_1	What are the current deals we have together?	
CIV4DiplomacyText.xml	USER_DIPLO_ASK_1	Could you spare this for a good friend?	
CIV4DiplomacyText.xml	USER_DIPLO_DEMAND_1	We demand that you give this to us in tribute.	
CIV4DiplomacyText.xml	USER_DIPLO_DEMAND_TEAM_1	This sure would come in handy...	
CIV4DiplomacyText.xml	USER_DIPLO_ACCEPT_OFFER_1	Sounds like a deal!!!	
CIV4DiplomacyText.xml	USER_DIPLO_REJECT_OFFER_1	It ain't happening.	
CIV4DiplomacyText.xml	USER_DIPLO_RENEGOTIATE_1	Care to negotiate?	
CIV4DiplomacyText.xml	USER_DIPLO_NO_RENEGOTIATE_1	Fair enough. (exit)	
CIV4DiplomacyText.xml	USER_DIPLO_GIVE_HELP_1	Sure! We're always glad to help!	
CIV4DiplomacyText.xml	USER_DIPLO_REFUSE_HELP_1	Sorry, but it's no rose garden over here either.	
CIV4DiplomacyText.xml	USER_DIPLO_ACCEPT_DEMAND_1	Well, if you insist...	
CIV4DiplomacyText.xml	USER_DIPLO_REJECT_DEMAND_1	We reject your empty threats!	
CIV4DiplomacyText.xml	USER_DIPLO_CONVERT_1	I agree. We will convert to [OUR_STATE_RELIGION] immediately. (Convert Religion)	
CIV4DiplomacyText.xml	USER_DIPLO_NO_CONVERT_1	Our people will never give up their beliefs.	
CIV4DiplomacyText.xml	USER_DIPLO_REVOLUTION_1	But of course... we now see the error of our ways. (Start Revolution)	
CIV4DiplomacyText.xml	USER_DIPLO_NO_REVOLUTION_1	You must learn to respect our differences.	
CIV4DiplomacyText.xml	USER_DIPLO_JOIN_WAR_1	Let's get this war started! (Declare War)	
CIV4DiplomacyText.xml	USER_DIPLO_NO_JOIN_WAR_1	Sorry, but we cannot afford a war right now.	
CIV4DiplomacyText.xml	USER_DIPLO_STOP_TRADING_1	You're right, we can't stand them either! (Cancel Deals)	
CIV4DiplomacyText.xml	USER_DIPLO_NO_STOP_TRADING_1	Sorry, but we just can't turn our back on them.	
CIV4DiplomacyText.xml	USER_DIPLO_SOMETHING_ELSE_1	Let's discuss something else...	
CIV4DiplomacyText.xml	USER_DIPLO_RESEARCH_1	We would like you to research...	
CIV4DiplomacyText.xml	USER_DIPLO_ATTITUDE_1	What do you think of...	
CIV4DiplomacyText.xml	USER_DIPLO_TARGET_1	Why don't you attack...	
CIV4DiplomacyText.xml	USER_DIPLO_EXIT_1	Farewell ... (Exit)	
CIV4DiplomacyText.xml	AI_DIPLO_ATTITUDE_PLAYER_FURIOUS_1	%s1 is a scourge on our world! (Furious)	
CIV4DiplomacyText.xml	AI_DIPLO_ATTITUDE_PLAYER_FURIOUS_2	%s1 is a snake in the grass! Do not trust [NUM1:him:her:x:x]! (Furious)	
CIV4DiplomacyText.xml	AI_DIPLO_ATTITUDE_PLAYER_FURIOUS_3	I neither like nor trust %s1. (Furious)	
CIV4DiplomacyText.xml	AI_DIPLO_ATTITUDE_PLAYER_FURIOUS_4	A despicable villain! (Furious)	
CIV4DiplomacyText.xml	AI_DIPLO_ATTITUDE_PLAYER_FURIOUS_5	%s1 is a deceitful cretin! (Furious)	
CIV4DiplomacyText.xml	AI_DIPLO_ATTITUDE_PLAYER_FURIOUS_6	%s1 is dead to me! (Furious)	
CIV4DiplomacyText.xml	AI_DIPLO_ATTITUDE_PLAYER_FURIOUS_7	%s1 is a very bad person. (Furious)	
CIV4DiplomacyText.xml	AI_DIPLO_ATTITUDE_PLAYER_FURIOUS_8	%s1? A treacherous cowardly baboon. (Furious)	
CIV4DiplomacyText.xml	AI_DIPLO_ATTITUDE_PLAYER_FURIOUS_9	%s1 is not worth a bucket of owl spit. (Furious)	
CIV4DiplomacyText.xml	AI_DIPLO_ATTITUDE_PLAYER_FURIOUS_10	%s1 is evil through and through! (Furious)	
CIV4DiplomacyText.xml	AI_DIPLO_ATTITUDE_PLAYER_FURIOUS_11	%s1 is a dirty, rotten scoundrel! (Furious)	
